window.AKK_SPEND_STEPMOTHER_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_SPEND_STEPMOTHER_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":201,"title":"Chapter 201: The Family","paragraphs":["The fifth day of the lunar new year.","Sheng Mumu and Qin Jiamu attended a wine reception.","It was a small celebration reception held by a financial magazine for companies on their annual rankings list.","The overall atmosphere of the reception was relaxed and casual. Though it was a celebratory event, there were no lengthy official procedures, leaving more time for the invited guests to mingle on their own.","Cooperation often arises from socializing.","As a company ranked high on the list, many headhunters had Mumu and Jiamu in their sights today, hoping to see if there were opportunities to cooperate with Yueji.","After chatting with a few investors, they unanimously felt there was no need to accept investment.","At this stage, compared to similar companies, Yueji's market share was continuously growing.","The better it develops, the more steady it should be.","They plan to first use the Shen City branch as a model to set up points in various cities, gradually gaining a foothold.","And so, Mumu and Jiamu were less enthusiastic during the second half of the reception, only occasionally exchanging a few words with others.","After a few glasses of white wine, they felt slightly tipsy.","At Jiamu's suggestion, they went to the balcony for some fresh air to sober up a bit.","There were some people on the balcony, leaning against the railing, toasting and drinking.","Mumu inadvertently glanced over and saw a familiar face.","She nudged Jiamu.","\"Sister Jiamu, isn't that Song Yue over there?\"","\"Song Yue? Who?\" Jiamu didn't react at first. She looked to the side before suddenly remembering, \"You mean Su Tingran's scumbag ex-husband?\"","\"Yes.\" Mumu's gaze fell towards the outdoor tables, increasingly certain, \"It's him.\"","At the outdoor tables were three men chatting, one of them Song Yue.","Jiamu said, \"Song Yue's company specializes in foreign trade. He cooperates with many different companies so it's not surprising to see him on the guest list.\"","Mumu murmured in agreement and looked away.","What a coincidence.","Just then, her phone rang in her purse.","It was a video call from Su Tingran.","Yesterday, Su Tingran had left for a trip around Europe.","Firstly to unwind.","Secondly, she envied that Mumu and Jiamu had their own businesses, so she also felt eager to try.","Compared to them, Su Tingran had a gentler personality. She didn't have plans to start her own company.","She planned to pick up her college major in fashion design again. If she could open a small clothing shop to sell her own designs, she would be very content.","The main purpose of this Europe trip was to visit the small independent designer shops.","The video connected with Su Tingran's gentle smiling face appearing on the screen.","\"Mumu, Sister Jiamu, guess where I am?\"","Mumu and Jiamu exchanged glances, stunned for a moment.","They had no clue.","Jiamu said: \"Madrid?\"","Mumu said: \"Florence?\"","They were just randomly guessing.","\"I'm in Milan!\" Without keeping them in suspense, Su Tingran revealed the answer.","Su Tingran turned the camera around to show an old street behind her.","\"There are many clothing shops on this street that have been open for over a hundred years. Some designer names I've seen on invite lists for Milan Fashion Week.\"","\"Tingran, don't envy. Once you open your clothing store,\" Mumu raised her brow, encouraging her in a tone, \"let's set a small goal first: participate in Milan Fashion Week.\"","Laughing sounds came from the phone.","\"Mumu, are you sure that's a 'small' goal?\"","Qin Jiamu leaned back casually on the couch, reached out with her long legs crossed: \"Setting goals is all about daring to dream big right? Want to hear my even bolder idea?\"","As her words trailed off, all three women laughed.","Not far away.","Song Yue's eyebrows twisted.","Ever since Mumu and Jiamu arrived at the balcony, he had seen them.","He wanted to pretend he didn't but couldn't remain composed when he heard that familiar voice float over, all his attention pulled away by Su Tingran's voice.","He heard Su Tingran say she was abroad.","Heard about her plans to open a fashion shop.","A fashion shop, huh.","Song Yue went into a daze for a moment.","It seemed she had mentioned something to him before.","At the time, he thought she was just bored staying at home chatting idly, and forgot all about it afterwards.","Now, hearing it again, it was like a blade stabbing his heart, squeezing it.","The tones from far away constantly reminded him","How he regretted it.","Every day after losing Tingran had felt fragmented.","Details built into his routine over time had slowly faded away.","He lost such an amazing woman.","The regret nearly drove him insane.","A gust of wind blew over.","Song Yue's thoughts were jolted awake again.","He raised his eyes towards the source of Su Tingran's voice.","But only saw two casual retreating backs.","Mumu returned home.","And chatted with Qi Mo about trivial things that happened at the reception.","Including running into Su Tingran's scumbag ex, Song Yue.","Qi Mo was sprawled lazily on the couch, long legs crossed.","His long arms stretched over the top of the couch behind Mumu.","Listening attentively to her speak.","\"You know...\" A mischievous smile formed on Mumu's face. \"I deliberately put my phone on speaker, deliberately spoke loudly, deliberately laughed loudly.\"","Qi Mo's large palm rested on the back of her neck, fingers caressing, his intense gaze slightly widening to show his great interest in her topic.","Mumu relaxed against the man beside her, letting him massage her neck while she hugged her arms. Raising her brow she said:","\"I just wanted that scum to know Tingran's life became so great after leaving him.\"","\"And there's more, Sister Jiamu really lives up to her name. She immediately understood my intention.\"","The corners of her eyes crinkled.","\"Sister Jiamu very loudly emphasized to Tingran to take the chance while exploring to find a male model to date.\"","\"She said Tingran was tired of looking at ugly stuff before, time to give her eyes a wash.\"","\"Heart piercing! That scum Song must have heard it.\"","Mumu laughed until tears formed at the corners of her eyes, her voice trembling.","Qi Mo just smiled without speaking, gazing down at her, a glow fluctuating in his deep dark pupils.","His hand never stopped, still kneading her in steady motions.","He found her puffy annoyed then loudly laughing expressions extremely cute.","He could never look enough.","After some time, Mumu finally stopped laughing. As if suddenly recalling something, she turned and said: \"Oh right, something to tell you. I have a business trip coming up soon, to Shen City.\"","Qi Mo's movements slowed in his palm, \"When?\"","Mumu: \"Leaving the day after Lantern Festival, the sixteenth day of the new year.\"","Qi Mo: \"Alone?\"","Mumu nodded: \"Yeah, alone. Sister Jiamu and Cheng Zhuo are staying in Jing City to handle company matters.\"","\"I'll go too,\" Qi Mo promptly responded.","Mumu blinked her eyes questioningly: \"?\"","Thinking he hadn't heard clearly, Qi Mo repeated: \"I said I'll go too.\"","Mumu looked at him seriously: \"I'm going for work, no family members allowed.\"","Qi Mo was stunned for a few seconds before his lips quirked up amusedly.","As if pleased by the word 'family member', his gaze steadily darkened.","Ignoring Mumu's words, he casually stated on his own: \"Okay, I'll go to Shen City too.\"","Mumu: ???","Um...","What's with this man, doesn't he understand people's words?","Mumu: \"I—\"","Just as she was about to speak, the large palm on her neck increased in pressure, squeezing once.","The man's voice laced with faint amusement cut her off:","\"There are some matters at the resort that I need to handle. I was already planning to go after New Year's anyway.\"","\"......\" Mumu fell silent.","Her gaze traveled over the man's casual unconcerned, even slightly delighted expression.","She narrowed her eyes, arched her neck back, suspicion in her tone:","\"Why am I so distrustful?\"","Qi Mo: \"......\"","\"Really?\"","\"Really.\""]},{"number":202,"title":"Chapter 202: The Feelers","paragraphs":["On the day Sheng Mumu left for the city of Shen, Qi Shaobai didn't accompany her to the airport.","The unfortunate third-year high school student received a notice to report to school earlier before she could even finish celebrating the Lantern Festival.","As she walked out of the airport, Sheng Mumu shivered from the cold.","The temperature in Beijing during winter was already quite low, but compared to Shen, it was nothing.","Before she could take out warm clothes from her carry-on suitcase, a man's coat enveloped her, and his warm hand held hers, leading her towards the parking lot.","The person sent by Qi Corporation's Shen branch to pick them up was already waiting in the parking lot.","The two of them bent down and got into the car, which then headed towards a resort.","After about half an hour, the car stopped in front of a villa.","It was the same villa they stayed in during their last visit to Shen.","As they stepped inside, Sheng Mumu pursed her lips.","She remembered there was an open bathtub in the master bedroom.","During their last visit to Shen, Qi Mo didn't wait for her to speak and voluntarily suggested he would use the adjacent master bedroom for his grooming.","But today, the man didn't mention a word.","Before going to bed, he took his change of clothes and bypassed the conspicuous bathtub, entering the bathroom that was only shielded by frosted glass on a few sides.","The sound of trickling water seeped into Sheng Mumu's ears.","She couldn't concentrate on anything else.","Her heart was in turmoil.","If he stayed in there, she wouldn't be able to take a bath.","No, she didn't want that.","Her favorite thing to do every day was to take a relaxing bath before bed.","When the sound of water in the bathroom ceased, Sheng Mumu collected herself and pretended to casually scroll through her phone's screen.","Qi Mo emerged from the bathroom, wearing a clean and loose T-shirt, and rubbed his towel-dried hair.","Sheng Mumu didn't lift her gaze, keeping her eyes downcast.","Suddenly, a pair of men's slippers appeared in her line of sight.","Then, she saw Qi Mo's well-shaped calves beneath his loose shorts.","Qi Mo didn't say a word. He walked to the edge of the bed.","He pressed one knee onto the bed, leaning forward.","Sheng Mumu's breath hitched, and she looked up in a daze.","His handsome and captivating face grew closer, hovering above her head.","A droplet of water from his short hair fell onto her hand.","Almost touching her body, his arm supported him on the mattress as he leaned in.","Sheng Mumu shifted backward slightly, so as not to collide with his chest.","Qi Mo extended his long arm, brushing against Sheng Mumu's shoulder.","He picked up his phone from the nightstand and straightened up.","Standing casually by the bed, he looked at his phone.","The light from the screen illuminated his face, creating a play of light and shadow, and his expression appeared as naturally calm as always.","Sheng Mumu was dumbfounded.","Why did he take his phone?","After a while, Qi Mo turned off his phone, rubbed his hair with the towel, and said,","\"You take a shower first. I'll go to the study. There's an impromptu video conference I need to attend.\"","With that, he strode away, closing the door behind him.","Sheng Mumu was left speechless.","Having a video conference late at night?","Doubt lingered in her mind regarding the authenticity of his words. Sheng Mumu filled the bathtub with water and added some essential oil.","Oh well.","She decided not to dwell on whether he was telling the truth or not.","While he was away, she could enjoy the privacy and take a bath first.","Sheng Mumu lay back in the bathtub with her head resting on a towel, making two small buns with her hair on either side.","The water temperature was just right, and steam rose in the air.","The fragrance of carefully selected tea leaves filled the air, offering a soothing and healing aroma.","She comfortably squinted her eyes, letting out a sigh of relief.","Suddenly, the scene from earlier appeared in her mind.","Something was off.","Something was wrong.","He could have easily walked straight to the bedside table to get his phone just now.","Why did he have to cross over from the bed?","Wasn't that taking the long way around?","Her fair and delicate fingertips gently skimmed the water's surface, creating ripples in the calmness.","As the ripples spread and the outermost wave disappeared, Sheng Mumu's eyes suddenly narrowed.","With a belated realization, she sensed the subtle atmosphere that Qi Mo brought with him as he approached her with his phone.","It was an ambiguous atmosphere named \"testing.\"","Should she avoid it or not?","Should she suddenly withdraw or take a small step back?","Every move, even the slightest micro-expression, would probably be caught by that cunning wolf-like man.","He was indeed a modest and composed gentleman, no doubt about it.","But before being classified as a \"gentleman,\" he was first and foremost a man.","Certain hidden and unspoken desires, even if not explicitly voiced, were concealed within his actions.","Sheng Mumu turned over and leaned on the edge of the bathtub.","The steam, infused with the aroma of tea leaves, rose up.","Amidst the misty and moist atmosphere, her ears turned slightly red in secret.","She had a faint premonition that something would happen during this trip to Shen City.","That evening passed without incident.","The next day, both of them revealed their workaholic tendencies and immersed themselves in their respective tasks.","In the following days, Sheng Mumu was busy conducting one-on-one meetings with her employees, selecting suitable candidates to be dispatched to neighboring cities for the establishment of branch offices.","Qi Mo also had no time to relax.","He did have work to attend to during his visit to Shen City.","The revenue of the resort was quite impressive, and the group planned to acquire several plots of land nearby to create a larger-scale vacation and tourism complex.","It wasn't until the fifth day when Sheng Mumu finished her work and was flipping through her phone's memo schedule that she suddenly noticed the reminder she had already turned off: \"Did you watch a movie today?\"","She glanced at the time.","21:47.","Qi Mo had called ten minutes ago, saying he would come to pick her up from the company, and he was probably on his way now.","Sheng Mumu pursed her lips and pondered for a moment before calling Qi Mo.","She asked directly, \"Are you up for watching a movie? Right now.\"","There was a brief silence on the other end of the line, followed by the magnetic and gentle voice of a man. \"Sure, I'll buy the tickets.\"","Two sentences efficiently decided upon a spontaneous date.","Sheng Mumu estimated the time.","It was getting late, and there were probably not many showings left at the movie theater.","It would be quicker if they agreed on a meeting point and went separately.","\"You don't have to come to pick me up. I'll go by myself. Just pick a seat and send me the address,\" she said before finishing her words, only to be interrupted by a low and mellow voice on the other end of the line.","\"I'm downstairs.\"","Sheng Mumu was taken aback, feeling somewhat helpless. She let out a soft sigh. \"...Alright.\"","She had told him several times not to wait for her downstairs at the company. If he insisted on coming, there was no need for him to arrive so early.","It made sense if he came to pick her up after work when they were in Beijing, but the branch office in Shen City required a significant detour. Coming all the way here just for this was unnecessary.","But her words had no effect.","Every time she walked out of the office building, she would always see his car parked by the roadside, his face wearing an innocent and pure expression, claiming that he had just arrived.","Sheng Mumu felt helpless and shrugged before heading downstairs.","Well, forget it.","I'll have a chance to reason with him another day.","As soon as she settled into the passenger seat, Qi Mo handed her his phone.","\"I've picked a movie, take a look.\"","The screen displayed a brief description of the film.","Sheng Mumu glanced at it briefly. It was an obscure art-house romance.","The man focused on the road ahead, started the car, and casually said, \"There aren't many options for movies. We only have two choices, and the other one is a horror film. If you want to watch a horror film, we can still change it now.\"","\"No, I don't dare watch horror movies.\" Sheng Mumu quickly declined, crossing her hands in front of her chest, forming a large \"X\" gesture.","\"In that case, this one?\" Qi Mo's gaze shifted over, and the corners of his lips curled up by a few pixels. He added, \"This film is more niche, with a bold directorial style. Take a look at the synopsis first.\"","Sheng Mumu handed the phone back with an indifferent expression.","\"No need to look if you don't want to. Being niche isn't scary, and a bold style isn't scary either, as long as it's not horror.\"","The man chuckled softly, nodded slightly, and tapped his forehead.","\"Alright.\"","One hour later.","When the male protagonist on the screen grabbed the female protagonist's hand, kissed her hand, and then moved up to her neck.","Sheng Mumu blinked in a daze, held her breath, blushing, and tugged at the man's clothes beside her.","\"So... it's this kind of... boldness.\""]},{"number":203,"title":"Chapter 203: Come Rain or Shine","paragraphs":["\"It turns out to be this... bold.\"","Hearing her words, Qi Mo turned his head to look at her.","The interplay of lights from the screen reflected on Sheng Mumu's fair face, and one could faintly see a touch of blush creeping up her earlobes.","After speaking, she bit her lower lip and, as if summoning up courage, looked back at the big screen.","Qi Mo chuckled softly and wrapped his arm around her shoulder, whispering,","\"I just read the movie synopsis. It's only bold, not overly explicit.\"","Implicitly, he meant that there wouldn't be any explicit scenes.","No need to be too nervous.","Sheng Mumu relaxed a little.","After all, even the most modern urban woman wouldn't watch an adult-rated film with her boyfriend on their second movie date.","However, her heart quickly raced again after settling down.","Ambiguous scenes in art films often tend to be suggestive, hiding amorous sentiments in the details.","For example, the protagonist's slightly bulging forearm veins.","Or the wisps of sweat-soaked hair by the heroine's ear.","The background music slowed down and suddenly accelerated, accompanied by subtle sighs.","Partially concealed and partially revealed, it aroused even more imagination than being straightforward.","Sheng Mumu felt a bit uneasy and warm.","As if to cover up her embarrassment, she reached to the side and took a sip of her drink.","Damn it.","It was a hot beverage she bought.","It didn't provide any cooling effect at all.","The theater was dimly lit, and a few scattered individuals sat in the front row.","She roughly counted and found about three couples among them.","Two of the couples had already leaned their heads together, discussing and exchanging thoughts.","The air in the theater was stagnant.","The hot breath accumulated more and more.","Sheng Mumu's face turned red, and she felt hot all over.","She couldn't tell if it was because the theater's heating was too high or because the palm embracing her shoulder was radiating heat.","A movie of less than two hours stirred up a whirlwind of thoughts in the viewers.","Upon leaving the theater, the sky was terrifyingly dark.","Several dark clouds floated in the sky.","The air was stifling and unbearable.","The parking lot was on the opposite side of the street from the theater.","Sheng Mumu said, \"We should hurry back. It might rain.\"","Qi Mo responded with a soft \"Mmm\" and held her hand, leading the way.","At the moment he held her hand, Sheng Mumu's breath hitched.","Her pupils slightly dilated.","It was scorching.","His palm.","It was unbelievably hot.","She glanced at him sideways, catching a glimpse of a flickering fire in his eyes.","Her heart skipped a beat.","So, he wasn't as carefree and indifferent as he appeared on the surface.","The two of them crossed the zebra crossing and walked to the other side of the street.","The bare branches of winter trees looked desolate without their leafy coverings.","The streetlights provided no shelter, casting their light unobstructed, fully illuminating the surroundings.","The sky grew darker.","Apart from them, there were no other pedestrians on the street.","Occasionally, a speeding vehicle passed by, stirring up a gust of wind in the stuffy air.","While walking towards the parking spot, Qi Mo suddenly released Sheng Mumu's hand.","In an instant, he lowered his hand and embraced her waist, pulling her into his arms.","Sheng Mumu collided against the solid chest of the man without any warning.","A sudden thud.","A roaring sound echoed as a motorcycle zoomed past.","Sheng Mumu hadn't reacted yet, but she turned her head in the direction of the noise.","She saw the dazzling light from the motorcycle's taillights.","The young man on the bike shouted as he passed by:","\"Sorry about that.\"","She narrowly avoided being grazed.","Sheng Mumu breathed a sigh of relief, grateful that she was safe.","Thank goodness.","Thank goodness Qi Mo...","She didn't finish her thought.","Suddenly, she stopped in her tracks.","It was because the motorcycle had gone far away, but his hand was still clasped around her waist, gradually tightening.","She was bound in his strong embrace.","The man's chest rose and fell with each breath, and she was carried along with it.","In the stuffy air of winter, she looked up and met his deep and bottomless gaze.","His pitch-black eyes sparkled like two stars.","They flickered and danced.","There happened to be a street lamp just above them.","Its dim light gently illuminated him, highlighting his distinct and handsome features.","Deep-set brows, a high nose bridge.","His lips slightly straightened.","Qi Mo's eyes narrowed, and he lowered his gaze.","At the moment she looked up at him, he leaned down and kissed her.","The tall figure of the man completely overshadowed her own shadow.","The chilly air mixed with the desolation of winter enveloped them.","His lips felt like an electric current, gently and repeatedly descending.","The man seemed unwilling to settle for a gentle kiss.","After a while, it became a dominant and possessive gesture.","His arm tightened, holding her even closer.","With one hand cradling her delicate face, his fingers slipped through her ear, gripping her chin.","In the winter night, on a street in a different city.","The composed and gentlemanly man transformed into a ferocious beast.","Releasing the pent-up desire, he let it seep out bit by bit.","Sheng Mumu's head spun from the kiss, her lips tingling.","She couldn't remember how she pushed him away.","She couldn't recall how they found the car and drove back to the villa.","Back at the villa, Qi Mo grabbed some fresh clothes and headed to the adjacent room to take a shower.","Sheng Mumu stayed in her room.","Although it had been a tiring day of work and watching movies, she didn't feel like taking a relaxing bath.","Entering the bathroom, she opted for a shower instead.","She thought about Qi Mo's overpowering kiss just now.","She genuinely worried that if she were to take a bath, he might push the door open halfway, and they would lock eyes.","Sheng Mumu thought she had already showered fast enough.","To her surprise, when she pushed open the bathroom door, Qi Mo had already returned and was sitting on the edge of the bed.","He had changed into a black T-shirt, and his broad shoulders filled out the shirt, looking incredibly attractive.","Clean and handsome.","Water droplets fell naturally, dampening the collar and shoulders, filling the air with moisture.","He sat sideways, his Adam's apple curving sensually.","Sheng Mumu pretended not to sense the imminent storm brewing in the tranquility, casually took a step forward, and planned to apply face cream.","Passing by the bedside, Qi Mo raised his hand and easily grasped her wrist.","She stopped in her tracks, her heartstrings trembling.","The man tilted his head, no words spoken.","His deep gaze was filled with thick and vibrant desire.","With a slight exertion of his powerful arm.","He pulled her into his embrace, settling her on his lap.","The man's breath engulfed her.","Gently and tenderly enclosing her, tight and compact.","No unnecessary words were spoken, and her lips softened as he kissed her."]},{"number":204,"title":"Chapter 204: The Collapse of Reason","paragraphs":["Two vibrations came from the direction of the bedside cabinet. The phone lit up.","A text message sent by the Shen City Meteorological Bureau popped up on the screen.","It forecasted that there would be rain tonight. It reminded citizens to get prepared and beware of dangers.","The ink-washed sky pressed the dark clouds down lower and lower.","In a villa halfway up a hill at the holiday village, the light in the master bedroom was on.","The huge floor-to-ceiling windows partitioned the indoor air from the outdoor air.","It was sultry outdoors while the indoor temperature kept rising.","The man moved his lips away and slid them down slowly. His breath sprayed on Sheng Mumu's neck.","His fiery breath made her heart skip a beat. She couldn’t help but clench his T-shirt hem.","The loose T-shirt stuck to the man’s body. By pulling it, she created several wrinkles.","As the wrinkles on the fabric grew deeper, the big palm on Sheng Mumu’s soft waist also added more strength to press her into his arms.","The other palm was placed on her neck.","The man’s bony big hand formed a sharp contrast with her slender neck.","It seemed that a light pinch would break it.","Sheng Mumu’s long eyelashes fluttered. Her breathing rhythm was led by the man.","She opened her eyes slightly and her heartstrings shook hard.","Qi Mo’s ears were very red.","Set off by his fair complexion, his ears looked even redder.","The air was filled with a wild desire that was about to erupt from his body.","Sheng Mumu avoided his burning gaze. She didn’t dare look again.","The man kissed her rosy lips and then her delicate petite chin alternately.","It was silent in the room.","All that could be heard was the faint gasps between their breath.","The man had control. The hot air he breathed out was inhaled by him again the next second.","His palm wandered while his slender fingers combed through her dark hair.","Suddenly, the pads of his fingers twisted and pinched her ear tip without any gentleness.","“Ouch!”","Numbness spread from her scalp while her earlobe ached. Sheng Mumu couldn’t help but open her mouth.","She had just let out half of the sound when the man swallowed it.","The dim light shone on every corner of the room.","When she came out of the bathroom just now with wet hair, she was barefoot. Several inconspicuous water stains were left on the wool carpet.","The indoor temperature kept rising.","Wet air leaked out from the crack of the bathroom door that wasn’t shut tight.","The air was humid.","At the moment, Sheng Mumu couldn’t think of anything.","All her thoughts and senses were led by the man’s moves.","The big hand on her neck slid down, grazing her delicate collarbones.","The rough finger pads stopped on her collarbone, trembling and caressing it slightly.","It felt as smooth as porcelain.","He wanted to linger there longer but he desired to explore more even more.","Sheng Mumu dropped her head with closed eyes, enduring his kisses.","Her heart pounded like thunder.","Suddenly, without any warning, the man’s big hand pressed her slender waist and propped himself straight up.","The world spun. Her back sank into the soft mattress.","In that instant weightlessness, she let go of his T-shirt hem in a panic and put her arms around his neck. She looked up at him in confusion.","His deep ink-colored eyes stared back at her.","Being fixed by his substantial gaze, her cheeks turned red.","The man had his arms propping on her sides and leaned over her.","Abruptly, he straightened up.","With crossed arms, he took off the T-shirt in one smooth move and threw it aside casually.","For an instant, the light right above shone down directly, dazzling Sheng Mumu’s eyes.","Soon, his sturdy figure blocked the light again.","The man leaned down. His slightly bulging arms supported beside her body once more.","Sheng Mumu pressed her lips together gently. Against the light, she could still see the outlines of the man’s smooth and firm abdominal muscles.","He had wide shoulders and moisturized skin. His slender waist and carved abs divided light from shadow.","The thick masculine aura surrounded her tightly.","There was no escape.","Desire was burning in Qi Mo’s eyes. The dim light flickered aggressively inside them.","His gaze swept across her moist crimson lips.","Then downward.","Her collarbones moved up and down slightly as she breathed.","Somehow, the straps of the silk nightgown had slid down her fair smooth arms to the brink of falling.","Beneath the soft fabric of the nightgown, alluring curves could be seen.","The floral scent of her body wash lingered around his nose.","It smelled nice.","The familiar fragrance somehow had an extra lingering base note this time that twined around his heart.","It was like feathers brushing across his chest, arousing an unscratchable itch inside him.","Qi Mo’s Adam's apple rolled up and down.","One of his hands slid beneath the mattress and held the back of her head.","The other big hand gripped her slender waist tightly.","He lowered his head for a deep kiss.","Sheng Mumu’s palms clenched abruptly and her eyes shook.","She grabbed a handful of the bedsheet.","The sweltering breath invaded all her senses. Her cheeks grew hotter.","Every pore became extraordinarily sensitive. She could hear her own heartbeat.","Thump thump thump.","Each beat struck her chest cavity clearly and randomly.","Her lips turned numb from his fierce kiss. Just when she finally got a chance to gasp for air, she had to hold her breath again the next second.","The big hand on her waist moved and lifted one of her legs. He held her knee hollow.","With their noses touching, breath mingling between them, the air brimmed with ambiguity.","The man’s sharp features were tinted with desire. His gaze was deep and affectionate.","His warm big hand slid along her knee hollow, grazing her delicate skin, moving downward inch by inch.","Sheng Mumu’s long eyelashes fluttered and her throat tightened.","The man right before her had an overpowering presence.","Her locked her with his eyes and controlled her with his hand.","Unignorable pressure came.","Like wolves and tigers, he watched closely for her every subtle reaction.","As if he would tear her flesh the next second.","His palm was so hot and his breath was so hot, too.","Blushing, she turned her head away to snuggle up in his arms.","Her emotions were entangled—panic, bashfulness, nervousness.","And one more thread interwoven inside.","It was anticipation.","Suddenly, the man’s husky voice with restrained desire scraped past her ear, drilling into her ears.","“Is it okay?” he asked.","Sheng Mumu tilted her face away and squeezed her lip corners together.","With flushed ears, she nodded slowly.","Shattered light burst out from the bottom of the man’s pitch-black eyes. He leaned his body over without leaving any gap at all.","“Turn off the light,” she said in a low voice.","The man’s moves stalled for a second.","The next second, his long arm reached out.","With a click, the bedside lamp went out instantly and the room plunged into darkness.","Like sparks in the dark, the switching sound ignited the stuffy heat in the room all at once.","She felt him getting closer and closer.","His kisses fell on her lips and neck.","Each kiss triggered shudders.","It was like electric jolts. Numbness spread all over her body.","Her sanity collapsed.","Even without light, she knew clearly that the silk nightgown must have been all crumpled.","It was pushed to her waist and pulled down.","At some point, the scorching palm on the small of her back exerted force to draw her closer.","In the chaotic mist, an edge cut through and cleared it.","Their breaths were fiery and their sweat was sticky.","Sheng Mumu lost all ability to think. Her fingertips sank deeply into the man’s muscular back.","It felt like being carried up high by surges of huge waves and then dropping down suddenly.","Just when she was about to crash, cotton balls held her and enabled her to land steadily.","Before she recovered from the vertigo, the next towering wave came.","It crashed.","In the darkness, she clutched his arms tightly like duckweed clinging onto driftwood.","Patter. Raindrops crashed onto the window ledge suddenly","Finally, the rain fell after the stuffy air had been pent up for the entire day.","The clouds that had accumulated raindrops seemed to pour down at one go.","At the beginning, the rain strands fell recklessly like an innocent teenager, heavily hammering the window ledge with fat raindrops, pattering.","Later, the rain became heavier and heavier.","There were several pots of flowers in the backyard of the villa. They hadn’t been moved indoors before the sudden downpour.","The flowers were disheveled by the unexpected storm and shook as if they were about to fall.","After some time, the rain turned lighter.","However, it didn’t stop.","Just when it looked like it had paused for a while, it poured again.","Throughout the night, several rounds of such intermittent torrential rain occurred repeatedly."]},{"number":205,"title":"Chapter 205: Sheng Mumu (War Damage Edition)","paragraphs":["The next day.","Sheng Mumu was woken up by the alarm clock.","When she tried to reach for her phone, she froze abruptly.","A pained expression spread across her face.","Soreness radiated up her arm and through her whole body.","She felt like a towel that had been wrung tightly, aching all over.","With great effort, she lifted her arm halfway before it dropped, finally reaching the edge of her bedside table.","She grabbed her phone and turned off the alarm.","Sheng Mumu forced her heavy eyelids open and glanced at the time.","8:15","She remembered that dawn was just breaking when she was falling asleep last night.","Last night...","Or rather, it would be more accurate to say “this morning”.","He had carried her into the bathtub for a bath.","By then, her eyelids were already drooping.","The last thing she heard was the hum of the hair dryer, and its warm air lulled her to sleep.","As memories of last night flashed through her mind, the arm around her waist tightened, pulling her against his chest.","She felt Qi Mo's forehead press against the back of her head.","His hoarse voice wrapped around her:","\"You're awake?\"","\"Mm, just—\"","Sheng Mumu's eyes flew wide open as she finished her sentence.","\"—awake.\"","Oh my god.","Her throat was as dry and raspy as if she had eaten a hundred Peking ducks.","Thinking of the culprit behind her loss of voice currently snuggled against her back, heat rushed to her cheeks.","She pressed her lips tightly together, not wanting to utter another word.","Although Qi Mo couldn't see her expression, he sensed her burying her face into the pillow.","As if wanting to confirm something, the man propped himself up on one elbow to look at her.","All he saw was her reddened ear tips.","Amusement glinted in the man's eyes as he grabbed her hand and gently squeezed her fingers. Slowly, he said:","\"Take today off work and rest.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"Mm.\"","A raspy hum of agreement escaped her throat, sending pain searing through it.","The next second, the man leaned over her.","He pressed a kiss to the back of her head.","Then he flipped over a corner of the blanket and got out of bed effortlessly.","When he returned, there was a cup of warm water in his hand, which he set on her bedside table.","Casually, he said:","\"Have some water to soothe your throat.\"","Sheng Mumu held her breath and reached for the water.","Her arm trembled in the air.","She glared fiercely at the tall man standing by the bedside, resentment swimming in her eyes.","The man's short hair was tousled, lending him a casual handsomeness.","Just as Sheng Mumu sent a piercing glare his way, he happened to bend down to pick up the t-shirt he had tossed on the floor last night.","He swiftly put it on, movements easy and unhurried.","After getting dressed, his gaze shifted to meet hers.","Seeing Sheng Mumu weakly sipping water and spilling a few drops on the sheets, the man's eyes flickered, and the corners of his lips twitched upwards.","He grabbed a few tissues to clean up the spills.","Then he took the empty cup from her after she drained it in one go.","He ruffled her hair gently, tone warm: \"Let me get you another cup.\"","Sheng Mumu waved her hand. \"No need, I'm fine now.\"","What came out was a full sentence.","The hoarse, duck-like voice was unmistakable.","An awkward pause descended on them.","Sheng Mumu pressed her lips together and levelled a long look at the smiling, self-satisfied man.","In Qi Mo's deep, fathomless dark eyes, a strange glint flashed.","It seemed like he was reminiscing about something.","After a long moment, he put the cup down and sat on the edge of the bed.","Propping himself up on one arm, he leaned closer and asked, \"Feeling better?\"","The distance between them shortened.","The mattress sank under his weight.","The red marks and scratches on his strong, pale forearms stood out prominently.","The scratches were from her nails.","The red marks were left behind by her pinches.","Sheng Mumu slowly swallowed and shyly dropped her gaze, deciding not to respond.","She pulled up the blanket and flipped over, indicating through action that she didn't want to talk and just wanted to sleep.","But she had barely rolled over when the man pressed up against her from behind.","His arm slipped under hers to wrap tightly around her slender waist.","He lightly nuzzled the exposed skin of her back with his straight nose.","Sheng Mumu: \"!!!\"","His breath grazed her skin, igniting sparks of sensation that made her shiver involuntarily.","Before she could react, soft kisses were already falling on the back of her neck.","Each breath between kisses elicited tingles across her skin.","Sheng Mumu gave a startled jolt, her body tensing.","Warily, she pressed down on the man's wandering hand.","\"Don't.\"","But the man didn't stop his ministrations.","Voice muffled and laced with heady suggestion, he deliberately feigned ignorance:","\"Don't what? I don't understand.\"","The last word curled flirtatiously.","Once one has a taste, one remains insatiable.","His arm tightened around her as his hand roamed unchecked.","Sheng Mumu's face turned bright red all at once.","\"You...\" She pinched the man's increasingly unruly hand, wanting to sound firmer but instead coming out feeble and weak, \"...stop pretending.\"","That he didn't understand.","That he would take liberties just because he had greater stamina.","What nerve he had.","Sheng Mumu pressed down on his hand to stop him, changing the subject:","\"I'm hungry. I want something to eat.\"","The man's arm stilled and he fell silent for several long seconds before finally letting her off the hook.","\"What do you want to eat?\"","After Sheng Mumu randomly named a few breakfast items, she picked up her phone, putting on a show that work matters awaited her attention.","The man got out of bed and headed into the bathroom.","The sounds of him quickly washing up and brushing his teeth could be heard.","When he emerged, his torso was still bare.","Instead of putting his t-shirt back on, he had changed into a dress shirt and trousers.","The metallic belt buckle clicked as he fastened it.","While straightening his cuffs, he strode towards the coat rack and reached for his overcoat hanging on it.","Seeing Qi Mo fully dressed in a suit gave Sheng Mumu a fleeting impression of him as a wolf in gentleman's clothing.","Right now, that description suited this man perfectly—one who made no attempt to conceal the smug satisfaction evident in his eyes and the upturned edges of his lips.","Sheng Mumu: \"Are you going out?\"","Qi Mo's mouth curved. \"Mm. To buy you breakfast.\"","Sheng Mumu blinked blankly, not understanding.","The resort hotel offered breakfast service that could be delivered directly to the room.","Amidst her confusion, she heard the man's firm yet casual voice:","\"I just want to go buy breakfast for you myself instead of having it delivered by someone else.\"","Sheng Mumu froze for a beat: ......","It was the first time she had heard him utter words tinged with a hint of wilfulness.","Momentarily taken aback, a sense of guilt quietly crept into her heart.","Actually, she wasn't that hungry.","She had mostly wanted to get rid of him rather than sate hunger pangs.","Just as she was about to say \"never mind about it\", the man quietly closed the door and left the room.","His parting words floated back:","\"I'll be right back. Don't fall asleep again. Wait until you've eaten before sleeping, be good.\"","Staring at the closed door for a long time, Sheng Mumu sank into a daze.","A warmth blossomed in her chest, enveloping her snugly.","She used to actually look down on men telling women to \"be good\".","It always seemed condescending to her.","But just now, his tone was gentle and casual, devoid of any trace of superiority.","Unconsciously, she discarded her prejudice against the phrase \"be good\".","With mingled warmth and guilt welling in her heart, Sheng Mumu flipped off the blankets and climbed out of bed.","The moment her feet touched the floor and she stood up, an aching numbness slammed into her.","Pain lanced through her waist as if it had been chopped off and then reattached.","Now she was glad Qi Mo wasn't in the room.","Otherwise she would have died of embarrassment on the spot.","On the woollen carpet, her silk nightgown lay crumpled, with signs of being torn open.","Recalling the scenes from last night, heat flooded her cheeks uncontrollably. She quickly gathered up her nightgown and tottered on shaky feet towards the bathroom.","She stuffed the nightgown haphazardly into the laundry basket, then turned on the tap and absently squeezed toothpaste as scenes replayed through her mind.","When she inadvertently lifted her eyes to the mirror, she froze, pupils quivering in shock.","Her neck, shoulders, collarbone, chest—all were littered with red marks.","Some faint, some vivid.","Overnight, she had transformed from Sheng Mumu (radiant version) into—Sheng Mumu (battle-worn version).","Sheng Mumu (battle-worn version) took a deep breath: \"......\"","Silently, she clenched the cup in her hand.","At this moment, an intense urge to murder the man who had made her feel guilty just minutes ago surged through her.","Do not pity men, it will only lead to misfortune and...hickeys."]},{"number":206,"title":"Chapter 206: There is no such word as\" tired \"in someone's dictionary.","paragraphs":["With weak physical strength and battle-scarred skin, Sheng Mumu was unable to go to the company today, and could only handle work remotely on her phone.","Propping up her heavy eyelids, she assigned tasks to do in the big employee group chat.","After eating the breakfast Qi Mo had packed and brought back, she sprawled out on the bed in the shape of a \"big\" character and went back to sleep.","She slept very soundly without dreams, until the afternoon around 4 PM when she finally lazily woke up.","Upon opening her eyes she discovered she was the only person left in the room.","It was a leisurely winter afternoon.","The air conditioner blew out warm air with a whooshing sound.","The feeling of being in another world after an afternoon nap had not yet dissipated.","She got out of bed and walked to the window, drawing back the curtains.","Her eyes suddenly lit up.","The earth, washed clean by the rainwater, was reborn, bathed in sunlight.","Looking further out, you could see the snow-capped mountain peaks.","The accumulated snow, together with the clouds, was illuminated golden yellow by the sun.","As far as the eye could see, the world was gentle and warm.","Sheng Mumu lazily stretched.","Grumble--","Her stomach suddenly made a sound.","Losing too much physical strength, she unpromisingly felt hungry again.","Just then, the door to the room was pushed open from outside.","Qi Mo appeared at the doorway wearing sports attire, his forehead beaded with fine sweat, the charcoal gray t-shirt soaked with uneven patches of sweat.","Sheng Mumu blinked in surprise, unable to believe it. \"You were just...working out?\"","Qi Mo nodded. \"Mm-hmm.\"","He was worried that if he stayed in the room, he wouldn't be able to resist disturbing her sleep.","So he simply went to exercise and pass the time.","\"......\" Sheng Mumu let out a light sigh, keeping the speechlessness to herself.","It was just... unbelievable.","Clearly they both had arms, legs, and torsos.","But in his dictionary, it was as if the word \"tired\" simply didn't exist altogether.","Qi Mo didn't understand the meaning behind her expression and looked at her questioningly. \"?\"","\"Nothing,\" Sheng Mumu didn't want to think any further about it and changed the subject. \"What's for dinner tonight? I'm hungry again.\"","After sleeping all day, most of her strength had recovered.","Since she didn't need to go to work today and the weather outside had cleared up, she didn't want to stay in the room eating and sleeping the whole time, and wanted to go out for a walk.","Grumble--","As soon as she finished speaking, another muffled roar came from her stomach.","Qi Mo's gaze lowered, stopping at her slender waist and belly, and slowly opened his mouth:","\"A few of Shen City’s business partners organized a dinner party tonight with a chef flown in from Taiwan to make Minnan cuisine. Would you be interested in trying it out?\"","Qi Mo knew she wouldn’t care who exactly was going to the dinner party, so he focused on emphasizing the chef and cuisine.","\"Sounds good! Let me go change clothes.\"","As expected, as soon as Sheng Mumu heard this, her eyes lit up brightly, readily agreeing in a second.","As she spoke, she briskly strode towards the walk-in closet.","When she walked past Qi Mo, she tilted her body slightly to the side.","She was walking too quickly, and the tilting motion aggravated the lingering soreness in her thighs.","Her entire body suddenly convulsed and she slowed her footsteps.","The man smoothly put his arm around her waist to steadily support her.","His voice was low and magnetic.","\"Slow down.\"","Sheng Mumu looked up, eyes sharply narrowing.","She thought inwardly: What's with this old fox pretending to be nice, as if he doesn't know that the reason I have to walk slowly is because of him!","Complaining bitterly in her heart, her expression naturally revealed disgust.","She tilted her head back and pushed him.","\"You're drenched in sweat, go away.\"","\"......\" Qi Mo's hand froze as he revealed cluelessness.","He was rejected.","Was he really that smelly?","Sheng Mumu strode away without paying attention to the bewildered man behind her pulling at his collar and sniffing himself.","She chose a turtleneck sweater that could cover her neckline.","She even wrapped a scarf around herself in a vain attempt to conceal things.","She put on light makeup that gave her a rosy complexion.","She coated her lips with a matte bright red color.","Her skin was originally fair and delicate, so as soon as her lips brightened up, her entire being glowed radiantly.","The tiredness had been concealed very well.","Sheng Mumu’s recovery progress (Pretty Version): 70%","By the time they arrived at the dinner party, it was nearly dusk.","The waiter respectfully held the door of the private room open for them.","The several men at the table were around forty years old. Seeing Qi Mo lead in a woman, all their eyes lit up.","\"President Qi has finally been persuaded to come after so many invitations. You’re finally giving us face today, huh.”","“This lady must be... Madam Qi, right? Pleased to meet you, pleased to meet you.”","“Madam Qi looks even better than she does in the financial magazine pictures. I almost didn’t recognize you, hahaha.”","The satisfaction concealed in Qi Mo's expression was undeniable as he slightly bowed his head in response, leading Sheng Mumu to their seats.","Having gone through several similar dinners and cocktail parties before, Sheng Mumu’s social skills had gone up another level.","Before long, she was chatting merrily with the wives of several of the executives present.","The conversation topics flowed freely, starting from Minnan cuisine, then on to Chinese cuisine styles, then the weather differences between Shen City and Jing City.","Wherever they thought of, that’s where they talked about.","She had an innate magic that made people like her and naturally let their guard down.","Mrs. Tang, who was quite a bit older than Sheng Mumu, had chatted with her for a long time and exclaimed how nice it was to meet her, saying that their interests really matched well and it was like they were unrelated sisters.","Although these were merely polite dinner party words, they did contain some sincerity.","Sheng Mumu smiled brightly.","Mrs. Tang quietly whispered into her ear, joking:","“Madam Qi, I have to tell you, I always used to think no matter who a successful man like President Qi married, it would definitely be the other party trying to get in by his status and wealth.”","Mrs. Tang gave her a meaningful look.","“But now I don’t think so anymore. On the contrary, I feel bad for you being so young yet finding a husband a whole decade older than you.”","Sheng Mumu was slightly stunned. \"......\"","She had almost forgotten that in other people's eyes, Qi Mo was a 38-year-old man.","She burst out laughing and responded softly, going along with Mrs. Tang’s words:","“Mrs. Tang, you don’t know about this, but there’s an online joke that says an old man is good because an old man causes less trouble, has retirement benefits, and is responsible for coaxing me until old age while I get to drive sports cars.”","Mrs. Tang paused for a few seconds before laughing loudly and repeatedly saying:","“Madam Qi you really are so funny.”","After a while, when the people at the table were enthusiastically chatting about something, Sheng Mumu nudged Qi Mo’s elbow.","She called him, “Qi Mo.”","The man looked over with gentle eyes. “Hmm?”","Sheng Mumu didn’t speak yet but was grinning from ear to ear, unable to hold in her laughter.","Using a volume that only the two of them could hear, she asked:","“Out of all the people at this table, I’m the only one who knows you’re very young, yet everyone else feels bad for me, hmm?”","The man's expression suddenly darkened as his gaze tightened.","\"Young?\"","Sheng Mumu was still smiling, taking a good few seconds to react.","Sheng Mumu: \"...............\"","It seemed he had misunderstood her words.","Sheng Mumu stared blankly, explaining:","\"No... not the one you're thinking of......\"","\"Not small.\"","\"No... young, young...\"","\"Young in age, young in age......\"","At this moment, her tongue and brain were like two separate entities.","Her mouth always blurted things out faster than her thoughts could keep up.","The more she tried her best to organize her words carefully, the more awkward the atmosphere became.","In the man's dark, rich eyes was a trace of sly laughter, seen yet unseen.","He already understood her meaning, yet still put on a confused expression.","He leaned back in his chair, casually crossing his legs in a lazy posture.","Watching her intently, interested to see how she would make up for her words."]},{"number":207,"title":"Chapter 207: Sheng Mu Mu: You should Eat less Meat","paragraphs":["Perhaps it was because the restaurant's heating was turned up too high, Qi Mo raised his hand and tugged at his tie.","His chin tilted up slightly as he adjusted the tightness of the knot.","He hooked his slender fingers around the tie, loosening it left and right.","His faintly reddened adam's apple bobbed up and down tantalizingly.","The corners of his eyes lifted leisurely, and the smile in his eyes grew increasingly obvious,","Mixed with vague, murky light, it leaked out.","There was an inexplicable, alluring sexiness about him...","Sheng Mumu had been quite embarrassed just now, racking her brains to find words to explain.","But the moment she caught sight of the lazy, casual appearance of the man before her, she understood instantly.","Sheng Mumu: ......","This man...was putting on an act again.","She glared fiercely at him, gritting out one word from between clenched teeth:","“Dog!”","An accurate appraisal.","The man was taken aback when he heard this, and his hand dangling over the knot of his tie dropped down.","His chest shook slightly as he let out an extremely contented, low laugh.","What a dog.","At this time if Sheng Mumu still couldn't see through the man's deliberate feigned ignorance, then her twenty-eight years would have been lived in vain.","She shifted her gaze away, no longer paying him any heed.","But her gaze had barely moved before her wrist grew warm—she was grabbed firmly by Qi Mo's large warm hand.","As if nothing had happened, as if he hadn't just been called a dog, Qi Mo casually took her hand and placed it on his crossed legs.","At the same time, he stroked her fingertips, smilingly asking her in succession three times:","\"You haven't finished speaking, why did you stop talking?\"","\"We weren't talking about dogs just now, it was something else.\"","\"Why has your face turned red?\"","He leaned lazily against the back of his chair, a faint wicked smile spreading across his handsome features.","He had exploited the word \"dog\" to its fullest potential.","Seeing that Sheng Mumu was unwilling to give him any regard, he pressed on her soft palm with the callused pad of his thumb, and opened his mouth once more:","\"Mu—\"","Just as he uttered the one syllable, he suddenly stopped short.","A pair of chopsticks stuffed a piece of vegetable into his mouth, blocking it up.","\"Keep your mouth shut, just eat.\"","Sheng Mumu gave him a withering look, reminding him in a tone suggesting he do just that.","Qi Mo froze, his deep set eyebrows visibly going stiff for a split second.","After several seconds of silence, he slowly inclined his head, so his long lashes concealed the concession and helplessness in his eyes.","Here and now, she had him at a loss.","He could only resign himself to accepting his wife's \"loving feed\".","Seeing that when he was eating, he wouldn't say words that made her blush, Sheng Mumu placed several bites' worth of dishes into his bowl.","Obstructing his chatter.","If it was something she had chosen for him, he would eat it.","The others at the table noticed the couple's interaction, inwardly exclaiming over it.","Chairman Qi was actually being so pliant after marriage.","It was as if he were a different person from the cool, aloof one he had been at past dinner events.","In the past, he had always exuded an intense, powerful aura.","He spoke little, and smiles were few.","He had often kept a polite distance from the crowd, with his smiles not reaching his eyes.","But today, even without the entertainer at the table cracking jokes, the corners of Qi Mo's lips constantly held a vague hint of a smile.","Qi Mo didn't care one whit about the glances around the table, tranquil and unperturbed as he played the role of a \"Married ManTM \" to a tee.","He ate whatever his wife put into his bowl.","After some time, he put down his chopsticks and suddenly called out:","\"Wife.\"","Sheng Mumu asked, \"What?\"","The man pointed at the bowls and plates in front of him with his gaze, asking with a hint of doubt:","\"It's all vegetables?\"","\"Oh, I did it on purpose,\" Sheng Mumu said matter-of-factly, cocking her eyebrows slightly. \"You should eat less meat.\"","She moved closer and lowered her voice as she supplemented:","\"Otherwise you're always prone to thinking this and that, taking perfectly innocent conversation in naughty directions.\"","\"...,\" Qi Mo was temporarily rendered speechless for a moment.","Sheng Mumu lifted another bite of stir-fried Chinese flowering cabbage to place into his bowl with her chopsticks, smiling radiantly.","\"There, eat more greens, it's healthy and it'll help dilute the colored waste matter in your brain.\"","Having said that, she raised her eyebrows, quite proud of herself.","Qi Mo: \"......\"","The dinner ended at about half past nine.","Qi Mo had drunk some red wine, so they took a chauffeured car. The two didn't converse much throughout the ride.","The only thing he said to the driver after getting into the car was: \"Drive faster.\"","After that he kept his head lowered, looking at his phone, seemingly occupied.","Sheng Mumu took a glance.","The screen showed what looked to be some financial reports from the group corporation.","He was busy with work so she busied herself too.","At Madam Tang's place earlier she had heard plenty of entertainment industry gossip.","She wanted to eat her fill of the whole spectrum of melon vine produce, excitedly browsing Weibo.","Each was preoccupied with their own matters.","Obeying Qi Mo's request, the driver stepped on the gas pedal.","The trip from the restaurant to the resort villa only took twenty minutes.","Entering the villa, Sheng Mumu bent down to change her shoes.","All of a sudden her arm felt a surge of strength—","—she was pulled by the arm by the man who had been made to eat vegetables all evening.","Without further ado she was pushed against the wall.","Sheng Mumu's eyes flew wide open: \"!!!!\"","Disregarding her look of shock, Qi Mo pinned her wrist down, lifting it above her head.","In a flash, the man's cold and clear aura pressed in.","The intelligent home system sensed the owners entering and the lights came on automatically.","Because it was nighttime, they were set to soft lighting mode.","Yellow beams shone down from overhead, etching sharp highlights and deep shadows onto the man's tall and straight nose.","Their gazes crossed.","In those pitch-black eyes churned a light that could scald someone, shrouded in darkness as it welled up.","Sheng Mumu caught her breath.","The strength on her wrist grew tighter by the inch, and with just one hand the man had both her hands firmly pinned above her head.","The handsome face drew nearer and nearer.","The sultry atmosphere was suffocatingly scalding.","Her mind grew muddled.","All of a sudden, her blouse was lifted.","There was the soft sensation of lips against hers.","Breathing grew uneven.","The kiss that seemed to last forever finally ended, leaving Sheng Mumu gasping for air.","But the man still didn't seem sated at all, the colors of lust swirling in those pitch-black eyes growing more and more intense.","He lifted his arms, effortlessly hugging the person in them up off the ground.","Sheng Mumu rose into the air with her back pressed against the wall.","She was wearing plenty, and couldn't feel the coolness of the walls.","Not only was there no coolness, but on the contrary it felt hot.","Compared to those weights he lifted at the gym every day, her weight wasn't even worth mentioning to him.","Qi Mo easily supported her with one arm, his other hand now freed up to reach downward.","He grabbed her ankle.","With a flick of his wrist, her half taken-off shoe was slid from her foot to the floor.","The shoe collided with the ground, making a dull thud.","That sound pierced the peaceful atmosphere, remarkably jarring.","Sheng Mumu's heart jumped in time with the sound.","The man gazed at her unwaveringly, flicking up an eyebrow, carrying some unreasonable force.","When he spoke, his voice was raspy:","\"After making me eat nothing but vegetables all evening, shouldn't we switch to something else now?\"","Sheng Mumu put her arms around the man's neck, wanting simultaneously to strangle him to death and curse him out.","\"You— nn—\"","The curses on the tip of her tongue were ground into fragmented syllables, melted amid their intertwined lips and teeth.","Temperatures shot upwards.","What was stolen away wasn't only their oxygen, but their reason.","The man's invasive kiss confiscated all her thoughts.","The villa's decor was Scandinavian minimalism, and opposite the sofa in the living room was a mood lighting simulated fireplace.","The flickering flame blended with the bright moonlight coming in through the window, interweaving light and dark.","It indistinctly illuminated two silhouettes.","The cold-toned villa was steeped in enchantment.","Sheng Mumu's eyelids were squeezed tightly shut, unable to see anything, yet colorful spots still flashed across her inner vision.","With the last shreds of her consciousness, she commanded the man behind her:","\"Don't...do it here...go...to the bedroom......\"","Her words fell and the man slipped his arms around her waist from behind, hugging her off the floor.","Although the route from the living room to bedroom wasn't far, with all the staggering stops and starts, it still took quite a long time before they finally made it into the bedroom.","Rolling back and forth, the two were sleepless all night.","The room was filled with ambiguity, stirring up the night."]},{"number":208,"title":"Chapter 208: No one can speak Mandarin out of the Northeast.","paragraphs":["Because of someone's misbehavior, it aroused Sheng Mumu's rebellious spirit.","In the last week left in Shen City, Sheng Mumu resolutely did not allow him to do whatever he wanted.","On the last day staying in Shen City, Sheng Mumu had a whim and suggested going to the fly restaurant they had visited last time in Shen City for dinner.","Although it was not peak tourist season, there were still many guests at the restaurant.","They took a number and lined up on site, and it took forty minutes before it was their turn.","As soon as they sat down, the proprietress came over with menus. Seeing them, the warm smile on her face paused for a second.","Then she smiled even more brilliantly.","In a simple, kind tone with a built-in funny northeastern accent, she said,","\"Two people coming to play?\"","Qi Mo and Sheng Mumu exchanged a surprised look, question marks in their heads.","The proprietress was in her fifties, wearing an apron. When she smiled, her eyes and mouth curved into upward arcs, making people feel good at first glance.","Before they could respond, she went on,","\"I still remember when you came to eat last time. I remember that handsome boy who ate three bowls of rice.\"","Sheng Mumu immediately realized she was referring to Qi Shaobai.","The last time Qi Shaobai came to this restaurant, he did keep nodding his head and kept eating rice.","Qi Mo tilted his head back and laughed softly.","It was his conservative way of responding when he didn’t know how to respond to the enthusiastic proprietress.","The super social Sheng Mumu wasn't afraid at all.","She quickly struck up a conversation with the proprietress, and switched to more intimate forms of address.","\"Wow, auntie ~ You still remember us!\"","The proprietress smiled: \"Of course I remember, how could I forget? Your family of three looks like celebrities, handsome. It would be weird not to remember.\"","\"I've been missing your food too, especially the crispy rice casserole, super yummy.\" Sheng Mumu responded in non-native northeastern dialect.","The proprietress laughed when she heard it. \"It's called crispy rice casserole, young lady.\"","Sheng Mumu had a serious look on her face, tilting her head back. \"That's right, that's exactly what you said, casserole fly.\"","After she finished speaking, the proprietress was stunned for a moment, then laughed out loud.","\"Young lady, you really are quite interesting.\"","The guests at the surrounding tables also laughed when they heard it.","The small restaurant used the most traditional paper and pen for ordering.","As Sheng Mumu looked through the menu, she slid her fingertips over the names of dishes where they lingered longer, and Qi Mo wrote those dish names down on the paper.","The ballpoint pen and writing pad were connected with a string, which obstructed the writing a bit, but did not prevent him from writing firmly and beautifully.","When he wrote down the seventh dish, the proprietress stopped them in time:","\"That's enough, that's enough. The portions in our restaurant are large. Ordering so much, you won't be able to finish.\"","Sheng Mumu took the advice and took the notepad from Qi Mo's hand and handed it to the proprietress.","\"Sounds good, then just these. I'll go get the soft drinks myself and not trouble you, auntie~\"","Saying that, she got up and took two bottled drinks from the cooler and handed them to Qi Mo to open.","Because the conversation mentioned Qi Shaobai earlier, Sheng Mumu suddenly remembered that she hadn't contacted Qi Shaobai for several days.","She wondered how the boy was recently and whether he was used to being alone in Beijing.","She took out her phone and sent him a message to check on him.","When she opened her chat with Qi Shaobai, an affectionate motherly expression appeared unknowingly on her face.","She typed and sent the message.","At that time, Qi Shaobai was taking a nap with his head on the desk.","The air conditioner was blowing warm air. The room was nice and warm.","The handsome boy was taking advantage of his youth and wore only a short sleeve shirt.","His phone suddenly rang, causing the desk to vibrate slightly.","He opened his eyes with a start.","Some sweat had formed on his arms, causing the test sheets stick to his arms. When he moved, they flipped up and fell back down.","Qi Shaobai lazily unlocked his phone.","On the screen—","\"Little Wish Pond Stepmother: Good boy, how's the review going? You're not slacking off and taking naps, are you?\"","Qi Shaobai's originally cold and lazy eyes suddenly widened.","He looked around.","\"Damn, you have clairvoyance...\"","He had just taken a short nap and already received a supervisor message?","Behind the desk was a motivational sticker that Sheng Mumu had custom made for him.","【i\"atchingyou(。???。)】","Together with the WeChat message he just received.","He increasingly felt the coincidence was weird.","Qi Shaobai leaned back in his chair and typed: \"Did you install a monitor in my room?\"","After receiving the message, Sheng Mumu was silent for a few seconds.","Then she replied: \"Damn, you found out? How many cameras did you find?\"","Qi Shaobai: ...","Lies become obvious when you make up too many details.","Qi Shaobai had been immersed in test sheets recently, and his IQ rose in a straight line, not as easy to fool as before.","He saw through Sheng Mumu's lies in a second.","Qi Shaobai: \"Interesting?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"?\"","Qi Shaobai: \"You guys went on vacation and left me at home alone, and still want to mess with me from afar? Are you doing okay?\"","\"Pfft—\" Sheng Mumu laughed out loud.","She passed the phone to Qi Mo.","\"Look at this kid, he got smarter.\"","Qi Mo glanced at the phone, the corners of his mouth turned up. \"You trained him.\"","The next morning, the two left Shen City.","A few hours later, they landed at the Beijing airport.","As soon as she walked out of the airport door, Sheng Mumu took a deep breath.","The air in Beijing City carried a scent completely different from Shen City.","Shen City was very cold all year round, the air always smelled clear and cold.","Returning to Beijing City, she truly felt that spring had arrived.","The gentle breeze blew on her face. The smell of fresh sprouting leaves lingered around her nostrils, very refreshing.","As always, Xiao Wang was waiting outside the airport.","Unlike before, today he had a somewhat strange smile on his face in addition to his professional, respectful, sunny disposition.","Xiao Wang took the suitcase from Qi Mo and put it in the trunk.","Sheng Mumu went to pull the back seat door.","Just as her hand grasped the door handle, the car window slowly rolled down.","Qi Shaobai's fluffy head appeared before her.","\"Surprised to see me?\"","Sheng Mumu's hand paused. She reflexively asked, \"Kiddo, did you skip class?\"","\"I wouldn't dare.\" Qi Shaobai rolled the window all the way down, rested his arms on the edge of the window, and pillowed his chin on his arms. His tone was frank and open, \"Take a look at what time it is now.\"","Sheng Mumu glanced at the time.","12:30","Lunch time.","Sheng Mumu thought for a moment and said, \"From your school to here, it takes at least twenty minutes even if you rush over, so you...left as soon as morning class ended and hurried over?\"","\"Yeah.\" Qi Shaobai nodded.","Because he was in a good mood, he dragged out the \"yeah\" tone happily.","\"I didn't see you guys off when you left, so it would feel wrong if I didn't come to pick you up when you got back.\"","Sheng Mumu was startled. Her nose suddenly felt a little sour for some reason.","So touching.jpg","She reached out and ruffled Qi Shaobai's hair, messing it up completely, his cowlick sticking straight up.","\"Little Qi classmate, how can you be so cute~\"?","Qi Shaobai moved his head back to dodge, but didn't dodge with full effort.","He twisted his eyebrows, maintaining his aloof and proud image.","\"Please don't describe me with such disgusting words...\"","\"...\" Sheng Mumu's hands paused, her eyes lit up.","Ah, even cuter.","She applied what she had just learned from the proprietress's words to describe Qi Shaobai.","\"Little Qi classmate, you are so interesting~\"","Saying that, she ruffled his hair into further disarray.","\"...\" Qi Shaobai gave up resisting. He had a helpless look, as if allowing the rubs and scrubs.","He drooped his eyelids and slowly shook his head.","Inner OS: The Internet has not fooled me.","As expected, no one can come out of the Northeast speaking standard Mandarin..."]},{"number":209,"title":"Chapter 209: The Extra Point Game","paragraphs":["As Sheng Mumu ruffled Qi Shaobai's hair, the man with the sharp features next to them took off his coat and casually handed it to Little Wang.","He then looked at the disheveled Qi Shaobai and gently said, “Let’s go eat lunch together, then I’ll take you back to school.”","Qi Shaobai tilted his head, his gaze going past Sheng Mumu to look at his dad. A surprised expression floated onto his face.","He had planned to just buy some bread or something at school to get through a meal.","He didn’t need to eat bread anymore?","Just as he was pleasantly surprised, he saw Sheng Mumu open the car door and shove him in, then get in herself.","When Qi Mo also moved to get in, Sheng Mumu closed the car door.","“You sit over there, I don’t want to be squeezed in the middle.”","Qi Mo: “......”","Qi Shaobai: “?”","The car Little Wang drove out today had six seats.","There was definitely enough room for them to sit in two rows without squeezing together.","Qi Mo obeyed and pulled open the door on the other side.","And so, a rarely seen scene appeared in the spacious luxury car—","In the expansive vehicle, the three of them sat lined up in a row.","Sheng Mumu was next to the left window, Qi Mo was next to the right window.","Sandwiched between them was their grown-up son, Qi Shaobai.","Although Little Wang’s driving skills were excellent and he drove steadily without bumps, Qi Shaobai still felt like he was on pins and needles, extremely uncomfortable.","It was the first time he had sat between his dad and young stepmom.","He could physically feel their all-encompassing fatherly and motherly love surrounding him.","It felt very strange.","He placed his schoolbag on his lap and hugged it a little tighter.","After eating a simple lunch, Little Wang drove into the First Middle School of Jing City campus and stopped in front of the classroom building.","All three of them got out of the car.","They exchanged a few parting words, then Qi Shaobai strode up the steps.","When he reached the topmost step, about to round the corner into the hallway, Qi Shaobai looked back. He was dumbstruck by what he saw.","They were still standing next to the car. They hadn't left.","When Sheng Mumu saw Qi Shaobai stop, she waved at him.","She also gestured at her wristwatch, waving her arms in a little running motion.","Reminding him to hurry to class and not be late.","Qi Mo just stood tall and straight, leaning against the front of the car. He tilted his chin slightly at Qi Shaobai, conveying the same meaning as Sheng Mumu.","A warm breeze blew through the hallway, brushing past the youth. It stirred the bangs against his forehead.","Qi Shaobai felt somewhat dizzy for a moment.","He saw his dad holding a takeout bag. Judging by the shape, it contained soup.","It was the soup he had wanted to order at lunch, but because the cooking process took so long, by the time it was brought to the table there hadn't been time for him to drink any.","When they went to pay, he had gone to the bathroom. He didn't know if it was his dad or stepmom who asked them to pack it up.","Either way...","This was the first time he had seen his dad standing there holding takeout food specially packed for him.","It was such an ordinary, natural scene.","Yet it made Qi Shaobai's eyes grow hot.","When he was little, he had hoped for this so many times—","Hoped that he could also receive care and concern from his parents like other kids.","Those childhood wishes had disappeared after repeatedly not coming true.","Yet now, after crossing the long river of time, eighteen years later, they were fulfilled.","The days passed by peacefully and uneventfully.","The mock exam for Jing City's senior year students arrived very quickly.","Qi Shaobai performed very well. As his temporary tutor and guardian, Sheng Mumu was proud of him.","After the mock exam, Qi Shaobai became more and more serious about studying.","He went to school early and came home late, voluntarily giving up rest time he could have had.","Every time Sheng Mumu knocked on his door to deliver snacks and fruit, she no longer heard sounds of him hurriedly hiding his Lego.","From Qi Shaobai's eyes, one could see steadfast, focused rays of light.","There was a kind of person—once they saw results, they would believe in the value of hard work and sweat, and work even harder than before.","Qi Shaobai was this kind of person.","Yet at the same time, not completely.","Compared to someone purely diligent, he would also seek a sense of superiority from the results, using them to prove he was different from the masses.","It was similar to a smug mentality like “See, if Young Master me wants to, with just a little more effort I can do very well.”","Sheng Mumu understood Qi Shaobai very well. She knew his desire to prove his own ability.","She understood the tainted arrogance and pride mixed in with his hard work.","Words like arrogance and pride carried somewhat negative connotations.","But for a seventeen or eighteen year old boy, if he didn’t have a shred of arrogance or pride, how would he be different from an adult who had been battered down by life?","Sheng Mumu had no intention of suppressing the unruly arrogance and pride in Qi Shaobai’s personality.","She just needed to keep an eye on it at all times.","Don’t let the pride develop into stubbornness and conceit, don’t let the arrogance grow into haughtiness and hubris—that would be enough.","*","Sheng Mumu was not the type who could sit still.","Little Qi was studying diligently, her company was developing smoothly, and her relationship with a certain black dog was also going smoothly.","All of a sudden, she felt a little bored.","She wanted to add some little pleasures into her life.","One day after lunch, she lazily sprawled over her office desk, propping her chin up with her arms as she played on her phone.","Bored, she flipped open her chat history with Qi Mo.","She would smile one moment, then knit her brows in complaint the next moment upon seeing occasional shameless words popping up from a certain person.","Suddenly, her fingers stilled, and she stopped scrolling up.","The screen showed the date from when she had worked to raise Qi Mo’s favorability.","She sat up straight, a thought popping into her mind.","That night, as usual, Qi Mo came to pick her up after work.","When they returned to Xiyu Yue Court, the car had just parked steadily and he hadn’t even turned off the ignition yet when Sheng Mumu called out to stop him.","“Qi Mo.”","Qi Mo tilted his head. “Hm?”","Sheng Mumu said, “I feel like there should be fairness between lovers.”","Qi Mo paused and looked at her.","Subconsciously, he started reflecting whether he had done anything recently to make her uncomfortable.","Before he could figure it out, he heard Sheng Mumu continue lightly and happily:","“You’ve played the game of gaining points. Now I want to play too so that things are fair.”","Qi Mo pondered her words, feeling slightly surprised.","Sheng Mumu earnestly went on, “Ever since I was little I enjoyed business simulation games. Slowly accumulating points and leveling up after enough quantitative change to spur qualitative change. You know what I mean?”","“Mm, I understand,” Qi Mo’s eyes smiled as he propped one hand on the steering wheel and turned to face her attentively. “Then what?”","“Nothing more after that,” Sheng Mumu shrugged. “The gist is, this time switch it up and have me play while you be the judge granting me points. What do you think?”","She spoke more and more eagerly.","She had that thrill of being about to start a new level in a game, slowly figuring out strategies.","Yet she saw the man before her not saying anything.","After repeated pushing from her, he finally opened his mouth and shook his head.","“I won’t play.”","Sheng Mumu said impatiently, “Why not? Isn’t it fun? You get to be the judge!”","Qi Mo raised his hand, reaching to the top of her head and ruffling her hair.","The next second, his pitch black pupils brimmed with indulgence.","“Even if you don't say or do anything, just by appearing before me, you already have full points.”","\"......\" Sheng Mumu’s breathing abruptly hitched. She slowly blinked her eyes.","She was stirred by the man's sweet words without any warning.","After a few seconds to collect herself, before she could organize her words, \"But...\"","She really wanted to play!","Not only because she liked business simulation games.","More importantly—to be fair.","She understood that feelings between a man and woman should stand on equal ground, side by side.","The giving should also be equivalent.","Qi Mo had genuinely pursued her before, little by little raising his standing in her heart.","She also wanted to experience racking her brains to cater to his preferences and delight him.","\"Alright—\"","Qi Mo suddenly reversed course, gazing at her as he lazily arched a brow.","\"If you really want to play that much, I'll entertain you.\"","Sheng Mumu froze.","???","Did his attitude change that quickly?","No, wait.","You actually want to play too, don't you, sly old fox.","Sheng Mumu gave the man with upturned lips a \"I already saw through your little schemes\" look.","Qi Mo paid it no mind. He seriously asked,","\"When do we start, now?\"","Sheng Mumu lightly said, \"Mm.\"","As she spoke—","She saw his gaze casually sweep outside the car.","The private garage was empty without anyone else around.","Across from them, the rows of luxury cars had headlights like eyes all turned towards them.","Qi Mo's hand shifted left and the car window slowly rolled up.","Sheng Mumu was taken aback.","From his actions, she sensed some ambiguous, unclear meaning.","Qi Mo's voice was low and unhurried:","\"Since I'm the judge, I should be the one to set the rules too, right?\""]},{"number":210,"title":"Chapter 210: I Wanted to propose to Her.","paragraphs":["\"As if!\"","Sheng Mumu pushed away a certain black dog that was getting closer and closer.","She said solemnly: \"Qi and I have made an appointment to do something important tonight, don't try to delay me.\"","Qi Mo was pushed away but he was not annoyed or surprised.","Glancing at Sheng Mumu's ears that had turned red in an instant.","Instead, he laughed softly.","In fact, he had no intention of doing anything.","He just wanted to tease her.","So he stopped the previous topic in time and asked along her words:","\"What important thing?\"","Seeing the man's body retreat, Sheng Mumu breathed a sigh of relief.","\"We made an appointment to work out. Recently he has been studying too hard, sitting all day, his spirit is not as good as before, and he is increasingly tired, so I plan to restart the fitness plan.\"","Qi Mo was stunned.","Work out...why not ask him?","Sheng Mumu read his silence and imperceptible astonishment.","In a tone of comfort and explanation, she said:","\"Recently there is a very popular jump coach online. We plan to follow the coach to jump together, entertaining and relaxing.\"","Qi Mo was still silent: \"...\"","Meaning, when he took them to work out before, it was very painful and torturous?","That's what he thought, but didn't say it out loud.","When it came to his mouth, it became a sentence with no detectable emotion: \"Oh, is it useful?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"What's useful?\"","Qi Mo: \"Is it useful to work out by following that jump coach?\"","She didn't know if it was an illusion, but Sheng Mumu tasted a hint of dissatisfaction in his plain tone.","She wanted to laugh.","The inexplicable sense of competition of men was indeed everywhere.","Although she laughed inwardly, her mouth still answered:","\"Today is the first day, I don't know if it will work yet, but it's not that important. The main purpose is to get Qi to move, combining work and rest.\"","\"Okay.\" Qi Mo retracted his gaze, moved his hand to the door handle, and opened the door to get out of the car.","Before closing the door, he lightly and meaningfully dropped a sentence:","\"Then you work out seriously, I will check the results.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"?\"","It took Sheng Mumu a few beats to suddenly react. Her cheeks flushed red in an instant.","Inspect...what he meant by inspection wouldn't be...","Sheng Mumu looked up blankly at the man standing at the front of the car waiting for her to get out.","Qi Mo had his hands in his pants pockets, standing lazily and loosely.","His handsome and three-dimensional features relaxed, his gaze looking over, his expression calm.","As if the flirtatious words just now were not said by him.","He even raised his eyebrows slightly towards the car, as if asking: Why haven't you gotten out of the car yet? Did something happen?","Sheng Mumu took a shallow breath: \"...\"","She could only comfort herself.","Forget it.","It wasn't the first day she had seen the wickedness of old dog Qi.","In her eyes, he was no longer the gentle and refined gentleman he used to be. His belly was full of dirty water that he had held back for thirty-two years.","Very bad!","Once used to it, she would not be fooled by his shocking words, she thought.","Hmm...","Fooled?","Why did this adjective suddenly pop into her mind.","Obviously she had left Shen City for a long time, how could the flavor of Dazhezi not have dissipated yet.","*","Sheng Mumu was a serious gamer.","Deciding to play the scoring game, she made preparations seriously.","She searched online for \"female chasing male strategies\", \"small surprises for boyfriend\"...","Every time she clicked in full of expectation, and exited disappointed.","What.","Either those methods were too tactful, contrary to her straightforward personality, or they were too ostentatious, not suitable for Qi Mo's low-key personality.","Sheng Mumu sighed, \"Forget it.\"","After all, the people who wrote the strategies wouldn't expect married people to read these things.","She turned off her phone.","Deciding to follow her intuition.","Abandoning those cumbersome processes, the three word true saying - use your heart.","Sheng Mumu was racking her brains about how to create little surprises for Qi Mo.","On the other hand, the man who seemed to be the passive recipient was also puzzling about one thing - how to subtly find out her ring size.","Then, formally, propose to her.","Last year at this time, they were brought together by the old lady, and finally became a contractual couple.","Since it was an agreement, there would be no need to take it to heart.","He just went to the Civil Affairs Bureau at lunchtime on a workday he couldn't remember to complete the marriage registration procedure like a task.","During the whole process, he only spoke a few sentences when the staff member registered the information.","There was no prior planning, no consideration of whether it was an auspicious day and time.","No wedding, let alone a honeymoon.","There were rings.","But they were bought by Executive Assistant Dong.","Not knowing her ring size, he bought back several sizes.","In Qi Mo's eyes at that time, marriage, wife, family, were words that could never be associated with him in his life.","Human beings are really wonderful and fickle creatures.","In just one year, his thoughts underwent an earth-shattering change.","He could no longer imagine what it would be like if she did not exist by his side.","Just briefly hypothesizing for a few seconds made his heart feel as if it was being pulled, extremely uncomfortable, and he didn't dare think about it.","He would not allow this situation to happen.","The idea of proposing to Sheng Mumu had been around for a long time.","Almost at the moment he realized he loved her, it naturally popped up.","But he had hesitated to act because he was struggling with how to hold a grand wedding that would leave her with memories for a lifetime.","One day in Shen City, she was watching a show on her tablet before going to bed.","The picture happened to show the male and female leads getting married.","He saw her lift the corners of her mouth out of the corner of his eye, leaning her cheek on her hand, eyes curved into a smiling arc as she stared at the screen.","At that moment he suddenly realized.","Rather than struggling with how to complete the long overdue wedding, expressing it to her was more pressing.","Once he had the intention, he began to secretly plan.","First of all, he had to prepare the engagement ring and wedding ring again.","He found that she didn't like to wear the wedding ring.","He didn't know if her fingers had become thinner or fatter, but the size didn't fit.","He was secretly figuring out how to secretly measure her fingers when there was a chance."]},{"number":211,"title":"Chapter 211: ❤","paragraphs":["5:30 pm.","Qi Mo's phone popped up a new message—","\"Wife?: I'll be downstairs at your company in five minutes, have you finished up?\"","The corners of Qi Mo's lips curled up slightly as he typed a reply:","\"Yeah, I'll come down now.\"","Today at lunch, Sheng Mumu called to say she would come to Qi Group after work and eat dinner together.","Five minutes later, Qi Mo appeared punctually downstairs at the group building.","Seeing a white sedan parked at the roadside, the car window slowly rolled down.","Sheng Mumu casually nodded up at him, beckoned with one hand, voice light and cheerful:","\"Get in.\"","Sheng Mumu drove to a garden western restaurant.","This restaurant was hard to describe.","In order to get a scenic spot that could appreciate the sunset, she had paid the deposit five days in advance.","As she expected, a nice view really brought people a good mood.","During the meal, Qi Mo was in a very good mood.","The most intuitive manifestation was that, usually she was always chattering away about what happened today, the latest gossip she heard from company employees.","But today, Qi Mo was more like the one who wanted to vent and share.","Sheng Mumu was secretly happy, secretly planning.","He was in such a good mood, when she took him there later, he would definitely be more surprised.","One surprise might add a lot of points.","She chuckled softly, unconsciously revealing a very confident look.","Only for a moment, then she pretended to drink water to cover it up, so the man opposite did not see.","After eating at the restaurant, Sheng Mumu refused Qi Mo's offer to drive, and went straight to the driver's seat.","Qi Mo hesitated for a few seconds without saying anything, and got into the passenger seat.","After a while, he inadvertently glanced ahead.","The vehicle had already driven out of the Third Ring Road, the road ahead was increasingly open.","This was not the way home, but in the opposite direction.","Qi Mo withdrew his gaze, his head tilted slightly to one side.","His face was completely calm, as if he had not noticed anything unusual.","He glanced at Sheng Mumu and saw that she did not intend to speak, so he did not ask.","Her sudden appearance downstairs at his company today, and booking the restaurant in advance, all sorts of abnormal actions made Qi Mo naturally associate everything today with the \"scoring game\" she had mentioned a few days ago.","So he cooperated by being a quiet passenger and referee.","Adults often have a tacit understanding without having to spell everything out explicitly.","With Sheng Mumu’s keen observational skills, she naturally noticed that Qi Mo had already discovered they were on the wrong road.","But she did not explain further, and continued driving seriously.","The two chatted intermittently.","After passing two overpasses, a huge billboard appeared on the roadside ahead.","It read—Open-air Auto Cinema.","Sheng Mumu turned the car into the open-air cinema.","She rolled down the window to show the staff member the movie ticket voucher she had bought earlier on her phone for verification.","Then she parked the car in the designated spot and turned off the engine.","Just as Qi Mo was about to speak, Sheng Mumu suddenly flipped over from the seat back, crawled through the gap between the two seats to the back.","She took out two pillows from somewhere.","Threw one onto her seat, then reached out and pushed the back of Qi Mo’s head.","\"Put your head forward a bit.\"","Qi Mo did as she said, lowering his head slightly.","A pillow was shoved behind his neck.","Sheng Mumu pointed at the small screen in the car and continued issuing instructions:","\"Help me turn on the radio, our movie frequency is 84.7.\"","Qi Mo murmured an \"okay\", stretched out his long arm and his slender, bony fingers tapped the screen.","When he tuned to the right frequency and turned his head, Sheng Mumu somehow had conjured up a bottle of red wine, two wine glasses, and a small kraft paper bag.","Sheng Mumu crawled back into the driver's seat and reclined it into a lying position.","Pinched up a wine glass in one hand and clinked them together.","The sound of glass colliding rang out crisply.","She looked at him brightly and announced cheerfully:","\"Done~ \"","The man was stunned, \"......\"","She had set up everything smoothly in one go. Even Qi Mo, a man whose face seldom showed any emotion, clearly displayed surprise.","So...she was not just casually saying things.","Not only did she book the dinner in advance, she had actually carefully prepared so much.","As he imagined her planning everything carefully for today in his mind, a softness suddenly arose in his heart.","The night breeze blew gently, the flowing clouds moved slowly.","Night had completely fallen, a bright moon hanging high in the sky.","Colorful lights were hung on the trees around the parking area, decorating this peaceful, quiet place far from the city bustle full of atmosphere.","This auto cinema had just opened recently, there were not many customers.","Including them, there were only seven or eight parked cars in total.","The screen was very large, the cars did not need to park too close together to have a good viewing angle.","In fact, compared to regular movie theaters, the screens at auto cinemas were not that clear.","But there was one advantage that made Sheng Mumu choose this place for the date without hesitation—plenty of private space.","They could freely discuss the plot while watching, without worrying about affecting others.","Open-air auto cinemas had a special kind of feeling, open yet private at the same time.","It was the kind of freeing romance that she liked.","The movie started on time.","The familiar dragon logo appeared on the screen.","At the same time, the surround sound system in the car turned on accordingly.","This morning when Sheng Mumu went out, she had asked Zhang Housekeeper which car at home had the best sound system.","Zhang Housekeeper couldn’t immediately answer, he wanted to say probably none of them were bad.","But this was obviously not a professional answer a housekeeper should give. He quickly searched for information to compare and found the car in the garage with the best sound system.","Now listening to it, Sheng Mumu couldn’t help but exclaim in admiration, “As expected of Zhang Housekeeper, the sound effects in this car are awesome!”","To avoid the embarrassing situation that happened when watching movies in Shen City from occurring again, she confirmed the movie genre beforehand this time, making sure it would not be “risqué”.","She chose a very popular movie recently.","It was said that the movie had a group of handsome male leads, fit bodies one finer than the next, very appealing to look forward to.","She was extremely excited.","She planned to appreciate and critique whether the online comments were true or false, whether it was really so pleasing to the eye as described.","Looking forward as she was, she did not forget the most important thing. She picked up the kraft paper bag, looked mysteriously at Qi Mo and said,","“I brought you a little surprise.”","As she spoke, she took out a pack of malt candy from the bag.","She had gone out specially during lunch to buy them from Jing City No.1 Middle School Back Street.","The malt candy was presented in front of Qi Mo. Sheng Mumu smiled brightly,","“I brought this for you, your favorite little snack.”","Qi Mo was stunned, his deep ink-black eyes slowly contracted.","He reached out to take the malt candy and put one in his mouth.","The sweetness spread out.","The stern, dignified aura around the man seemed to be soaked in sweetness. The corners of his mouth unconsciously turned up. His handsome face had a hint of a smile.","Seeing him smiling secretly, Sheng Mumu timely leaned forward and eagerly asked:","“How is it? My whole date plan today is pretty good right? Can I get extra points?”","She thought the dating options she chose today were especially good.","It must add a lot of points!","Hm! Very confident.","Qi Mo paused briefly, silently for a few seconds, then his gaze turned gentle as it revolved around Sheng Mumu’s fair face.","Sheng Mumu's bright eyes were filled with anticipation, eagerly wanting to know the answer.","Qi Mo didn't keep her on tenterhooks anymore, slowly opened his lips,","“Of course.”","“How many points?\" Sheng Mumu's eyes lit up.","Even at worst she thought there should at least be several tens, right, she thought.","Just as she was thinking, she suddenly heard the man's lazy voice with a hint of laughter coming:","\"0.5 points.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"??????\""]},{"number":212,"title":"Chapter 212: The Rich Man and the Black Dog","paragraphs":["The tenderness and sweetness that had just risen in Sheng Mumu's eyes instantly froze.","In addition to the shock, her mind spun especially fast, and words jumped out one by one.","\"You...you...have the nature of a businessman, petty, unreasonable, extremely cunning and deceitful!\"","Faced with accusations, Qi Mo was calm and composed. He didn't even think of refuting at all, shrugging slightly and laughing.","The deep brow and eye showed a relaxed and calm, and even a bit of \"I'm the referee\" smugness.","Seeing his appearance, Sheng Mumu was so angry that she almost kicked him out of the car.","Qi Mo reached out with his long arms and pulled her into his arms, gently stroking her shoulders.","It was like coaxing her, but not compromising at all.","As if the 0.5 points were already set in stone, there would be no more changes.","He pointed at the movie screen outside with his eyes.","He said casually, \"Watch the movie.\"","\"......\"","Sheng Mumu organized language for a long time, and finally chose to forget it.","She was too lazy to spend more words with this increasingly unabashedly unreasonable man.","She decided to watch the movie first and find another chance to settle old scores later.","She glared at him, then turned to look at the screen.","Not long after, the irritable mood gradually eased.","Forget about the 0.5 points, and concentrate on the plot.","At this point, on the contrary, it was the man who had been calm and complacent next to him who became strange.","When Sheng Mumu looked at the rows of perfect abs on the screen with admiring eyes, the man coughed and asked her if there was any mineral water in the car.","Sheng Mumu didn't move her eyes and casually replied,","\"The fridge is right behind, go take a look.\"","\"Help me find it.\"","Sheng Mumu slowly turned her head with full confusion: \"?\"","The man looked completely calm, as if he didn't think his request was too much. He added innocently and politely, \"Okay?\"","\"......\"","Sheng Mumu: My mother tongue is speechless.jpg","She scolded him silently with her eyes, reached back with her hand, pulled open the small fridge, and threw a bottle of mineral water at him.","An hour later...","The movie was playing the highlight that countless sisters had unanimously voted online.","Sheng Mumu pressed her hands tightly against her chin, sitting up from her lying position.","Seeing the handsome male lead turn on horseback and shoot arrows in the movie, she couldn't help but exclaim:","\"So handsome——\"","At this moment, her elbow was suddenly pulled.","Looking back, the big palm that touched her elbow was shrinking back.","Qi Mo raised his hand and pressed the back of his hand against his forehead, saying:","\"I think my head feels a little hot, can you check if it is?\"","\"......\" Sheng Mumu took a shallow breath.","After calming her anger, she roughly reached out and touched the man's forehead.","\"It's not hot, it's even a little cold.\"","Qi Mo frowned, \"Oh? Is that so, then—\"","Before the words fell, a finger was pressed against his lips to stop his unfinished words.","\"Shhh......don't talk.\"","Sheng Mumu looked at Qi Mo with an \"I see through you\" expression, staring deeply at him.","There was a hint of dullness in Qi Mo's eyes. Under Sheng Mumu's warning gaze, he slowly nodded at his forehead.","In the following time, Qi Mo indeed had no more discomfort anywhere, nor did he need Sheng Mumu's \"help\".","He watched the whole movie quietly, honestly and quietly.","In fact, even Qi Mo himself couldn't believe that those actions would happen to him.","Seeing Sheng Mumu appreciating other men's faces or figures, he felt inexplicably upset and restless in his heart.","He couldn't help but want to make some noise to grab her attention.","It was a childish and instinctive behavior.","On the way back, Qi Mo drove.","Sheng Mumu leaned back in the passenger seat, with a hint of smile in her clear eyes. She suddenly opened her mouth:","\"Qi Mo, do you know what you looked like just now?\"","The man's eyes stagnated for a moment, and the fingers holding the steering wheel curled up slightly. He said solemnly:","\"Like what.\"","\"Very much like...\" Sheng Mumu tapped her chin with her finger, dragging out a teasing tone, \"A landlord guarding his land.\"","Qi Mo stopped: \"......\"","After a few seconds of silence, he raised his hand and pulled at his tie, a low laugh spilled from the corner of his mouth. He imitated Sheng Mumu's tone of voice with emphasis on every word:","\"Thank you.\"","As soon as Sheng Mumu heard this, her eyes bent.","\"Oh? Chairman Qi, what are you thanking me for? For praising you as a landlord?\"","\"Thank you for not describing me as a guard dog.\" Qi Mo replied.","Recently, she always called him Qi Black Dog. Compared to \"black dog\", \"landlord\" was at least human.","\"Pff—\" Sheng Mumu laughed, laughing and holding on to the edge of the car window.","Merciless stab: \"It's still you who understand yourself better, Qi Black Dog.\"","\"......\"","The man felt quite helpless but couldn't do anything about her.","With one hand on the steering wheel, he freed up the other to grab her nape.","He pinched it as punishment.","\"Ah—— Hahahaha——\"","It didn't hurt, but it was ticklish.","Sheng Mumu dodged while laughing.","Qi Mo retracted his arm and continued driving.","Listening to the pleasant laugh that hadn't stopped by his ear, he unconsciously raised the corners of his lips too.","His eyebrows and eyes gradually relaxed, revealing a hint of gentleness.","Fool.","It wasn't just a small piece of land.","It was clearly a vast and boundless treasure.","That night, as soon as Sheng Mumu hit the bed, she fell asleep.","At noon, in order to go to Beijing No. 1 Middle School to buy malt sugar, she gave up her nap time.","People who were used to taking naps would feel an exaggerated sense of fatigue if they missed a day of sleep.","Before eleven o'clock, she washed up and went to bed early without even playing with her phone before falling asleep deeply.","Three hours after she fell asleep, Qi Mo was gently pulled off the quilt in the stillness.","Three hours should be deep asleep.","It was time.","Qi Mo didn't turn on the lights. Using the faint moonlight leaking through the cracks in the curtains, he moved her knees pressed against his thighs away.","Afraid that she would notice, he held his breath and used his palm to hold her knee and put it on the mattress.","Then, he quietly got out of bed, took out a small box from the trousers on the stool at the end of the bed.","Walking lightly back to the other side of the bed, he knelt down.","His eyes gradually got used to the dark environment, and he could see most of the contours.","Seeing that the person on the bed had her eyes closed, breathing evenly and sleeping deeply, he dared to slowly hold up her wrist.","The moonlight was like silver, spilling a ray into the room.","The beam of light happened to slash across the man's face at an angle.","It brushed over his handsome brows and eyes, swept over his nose, and shook at the edge of his drooping hair.","Just a small bundle of moonlight was enough to reveal the tension in his heart.","His straight eyebrows were twisted together, his long lashes trembled lightly, and his thin lips were pursed tightly.","There was a dull light shining in his dark eyes.","He opened the ring box.","From top to bottom, there were three rings of the same style but of different sizes neatly placed in the square box.","Considering that it would be difficult to measure with a tape measure in the dark environment, the shrewd man had prepared three rings.","They were bought just to measure her finger size and used as a tool.","Maintaining his usual rigorous style, he had even thought in advance about how to explain it if she suddenly woke up halfway.","After going over the process in his head again, Qi Mo breathed lightly. His Adam's apple rolled silently.","Lowering his eyes, holding his breath, he took out the ring on the very top.","He gently lifted Sheng Mumu's wrist and slipped the ring over her ring finger."]},{"number":213,"title":"Chapter 213: The Proposal","paragraphs":["The best laid plans often go awry.","The ring had just slipped past the first knuckle of her ring finger when the person in bed suddenly stirred.","Sheng Mumu mumbled softly as she slowly opened her sleepy eyes.","In but a moment, she closed them by instinct.","After two seconds, as if needing time to process things, she abruptly opened her eyes again.","Her pupils shook violently.","The tall, kneeling black shadow beside the bed frightened her into crying out as she sat up and hastily pressed the switch to turn on the bedside lamp.","The light flashed on brightly.","Only when she saw that the black shadow was Qi Mo did her frantically pounding heart finally calm down a bit.","Her voice still carried tremors of shock:","“Why are you not sleeping at this late hour and squatting there...”","Qi Mo did not look at her. His gaze swept toward the crack between the bedside table and the bed.","Just now when she had awakened and reflexively pulled her hand back, the ring had dropped into the crevice.","He had planned at least three backup excuses, but not one could be used now.","The man, skilled at negotiations and controlling the scene in the business world, was panicking.","He lowered his head to look for the fallen ring.","As if to conceal his fluster, he lightly uttered a sentence in an inscrutable tone: “Mm.”","Sheng Mumu: “????”","Sheng Mumu was puzzled.","What kind of answer was “Mm”?","Why was he squatting on the floor so late at night?","Couldn’t sleep so suddenly wanted to do push-ups?","Qi Mo did not seem intent on resolving her confusion. He remained hunched over, groping about in the narrow gap.","The gap was truly too small. A man’s arms were not as slender and supple as a woman’s, so it was very difficult for him to reach inside.","Sheng Mumu looked at his broad shoulders, blinking her eyes doubtfully.","Suddenly, as if realizing something, she opened her eyes slightly wider.","She recalled the cool metallic sensation on her fingertips right before she had opened her eyes earlier.","She also remembered the tension in Qi Mo’s jet-black pupils the instant the light had come on.","Plus there was his kneeling pose...","Various scenes linked together in Sheng Mumu’s mind...","Sheng Mumu silently clenched her fists, grasping the bedsheet so that faint wrinkles appeared.","Many questions bubbled up that she wanted to ask, wanted confirmation about, but she held them in, rendered speechless.","After a long silence, she finally gave voice to the most direct question:","“Qi Mo, were you trying...to propose to me earlier?”","The man’s broad shoulders gave a visible jolt as his movements halted.","He raised his head.","The lamplight splashed over his cold, pale skin, cloaking him in a layer of soft, warm radiance.","In those dark eyes slowly surfaced the tense sincerity of one whose plans had gone awry, mingled with a hint of guilt.","Already low and magnetic, his voice took on a stirring charm in the deep of night as notes of disappointment floated over.","It seeped into Sheng Mumu’s eardrums.","He said:","“Yes, I wanted to propose to you.”","“A proposal requires a ring. I wasn’t sure of your finger size, so I thought I’d measure while you slept...”","He heaved a very light sigh.","“But I botched it.”","“I’m sorry.”","He had never felt so vexed at his own foolishness.","Secretly taking her ring measurement, planning a surprise proposal to dazzle her, preparing a grand, unforgettable wedding—it should have progressed step-by-step.","Yet now, he had crashed at the first step.","Sheng Mumu silently watched the man still kneeling by the bedside, not uttering a word.","The alarm she had initially felt gradually settled into calm.","After listening to Qi Mo’s explanation, her heart seemed wrapped in a gently flowing warmth.","Not the breathless pounding of lovers exchanging vows of love,","Nor the nervous quickening that came with intimate skinship.","It was a warmth very characteristic of Qi Mo—solemn and gentle.","The seriousness in his tone explaining things, the softness of his sighing voice.","And moreover, flickering clearly in the depths of his dark pupils, the vexation and remorse.","Everything, everything converged into a silent yet all-encompassing stream of warmth.","A sense of security, substantial as could be, came billowing over her.","Abruptly, Sheng Mumu leaned forward to cup Qi Mo’s face in her hands and declared ringingly:","“Okay.”","“What?” Sandwiched between her hands, one ear partially covered, Qi Mo did not hear clearly.","The next second, Sheng Mumu smiled.","Dimples dented into sweet indentations.","She repeated herself: “I said okay.”","In a flash, Qi Mo clearly heard the intense pounding of his own heart against his ribcage. Just as he was about to speak, Sheng Mumu’s gentle voice floated down from over his head:","“Whether you wanted to secretly measure my ring size, couldn’t sleep in the dead of night and wanted to do push-ups by the bedside, or you wanted to propose, it’s all okay with me. I agree.”","As her words fell, the darkness of the man’s eyes ignited with a fiery glow, brightly scintillating like nephrite jade.","Not giving him a chance to speak, Sheng Mumu held his face and drew near, rubbing the tip of her nose affectionately against his.","Then she suddenly pulled back, grinning playfully.","“Sealed~”","Her existence in this world, her current self, then meeting Qi Mo.","It had all occurred naturally.","So too did this—bursting in on the man’s little scheme, then accepting the bungled proposal. It seemed almost inevitable.","Each step in their relationship’s development had never resembled the earth-shattering love stories in novels.","In a daze, Sheng Mumu recalled a scene about a year ago.","In this same bedroom, also late at night, something similar had happened.","It was not long after she had first come to live in this house. Qi Mo had suddenly returned home late and lain down beside her.","She had secretly admired his brows and eyes in the dim moonlight, when he had abruptly awakened.","In just a year, their roles had reversed.","The one harboring secret thoughts while she slept had become Qi Mo, and the one opening her eyes to stumble upon this scene was now her.","They had gotten to know each other in the stillness of silence.","Gradually grown familiar amidst the dull routine of daily life.","The earth completed one revolution around the sun.","And now, on another tranquil night, they made the decision to accompany each other for life.","No wrenching heartbreak, no towering waves, nothing that could be called passionate or fiery.","It was as if they had returned to those eras where everything moved slowly.","Taking so much time to become acquainted, then taking even more time to cautiously feel their way closer bit by bit.","Every node where they crossed a threshold of intimacy could be described as “just right.”","He was introverted and of few words, while she happened to be vivacious and talkative.","She liked to ramble on and share things, and he liked to listen.","The flowing waters of “affection” had simply meandered here by chance.","It was time to turn toward the sea, steering into vaster skies to become “married” in the true sense.","Everything had happened naturally, as if they were always meant to accompany each other through life.","Like how the first snowfall had happened to descend when he confessed.","Like aquatic plants drifting nearby just as little fishes swam past underwater.","Like looking up while running through the rain, then happening upon an eave sheltering from the wetness.","Like when she was happy or dejected with no one around, yet her phone would suddenly light up with his incoming call.","Level-headed as Sheng Mumu was, she had allowed herself that rare moment of fanciful sentimentality.","But it did not last long before she retracted her hands from the man’s face.","Bending down, she reached toward the bedside table gap.","As if destined by some invisible hand, her searching fingertips instantly touched the ring that Qi Mo had been unable to find.","The ring design was simple without any embedded gems, only the brand logo engraved inside.","She slipped it onto her ring finger and studied it from both sides. “It fits perfectly, not too tight or loose.”","Qi Mo grasped her wrist. “This isn’t an engagement ring. It was only for measuring size. We’ll pick the actual wedding bands later—”","“I like this one,” Sheng Mumu interrupted him. “Let’s just use this.”","She recognized the brand. Even their most basic style would cost at least seven figures.","Using it as a one-time sizing tool was truly too extravagant.","Plus she had always believed diamond rings were a consumerist trap.","Savvy as she was, how could she be willing to fall for such material ploys?","She eyed the two larger sized rings in the box, bright eyes glimmering shrewdly.","“This is great. Now there are three. If I get fat later, I can directly switch to the bigger size and save money.”","Qi Mo smiled wryly. “You needn’t save me money.”","“Who’s saving you money?” Sheng Mumu glared at him. “Your money is my money. I’m saving for myself.”","Qi Mo paused briefly before breaking into a low chuckle.","“Yes, my wife.”"]},{"number":214,"title":"Chapter 214: Free and Romantic","paragraphs":["Sheng Mumu decided to set the wedding date half a year later.","There were two reasons for this.","Firstly, Qi Shaobai was about to take the college entrance examination, and if the wedding was held in the near future, it would inevitably affect his study progress.","Secondly, the college entrance examination coincided with the summer season, and Sheng Mumu didn't want to be wearing a heavy wedding gown in the scorching heat. So, she decided to postpone it again.","After careful consideration, they found that the cool and pleasant October would be the most suitable time.","As for how to plan the wedding, the next day, Qi Mo presented several well-prepared options to Sheng Mumu, as if submitting a report to a superior. He handed her a printed booklet containing the detailed plans.","Sheng Mumu paused for a few seconds and then smiled as she opened it.","While going through the booklet, she occasionally glanced at the man sitting across from her, his face filled with seriousness, waiting for her decision.","The plan included, but was not limited to, themes such as a European-style church wedding, a beach island banquet, a vintage Chinese-style wedding, and so on.","Each theme had a schedule, illustrations, and alternative plans for unexpected situations.","No detail was overlooked.","From the major process of naming an island in advance for the purchase to the small detail of waiting for the handcrafted wedding carpet to be made.","Sheng Mumu clicked her tongue and couldn't help but exclaim, \"Qi Mo, President Qi, just by looking at this plan, I can almost imagine how strict and terrifying you were as a science and engineering genius during your student years.\"","Qi Mo's brows relaxed as he raised his chin, interpreting her words as praise. He didn't deny it and smirked slightly, bringing the topic back and asking, \"Out of these themes, do you have any favorites?\"","\"No,\" Sheng Mumu honestly replied.","Before the man's pleased smile could fully appear, it froze on his handsome face for a second.","Sheng Mumu calmly said, \"Recently, I've seen many young people sharing their experiences of preparing for weddings on social media, and the more I read, the more I find it troublesome.\"","\"Even if I try to put myself in their shoes, I already feel exhausted before even starting the preparations. It's just too difficult.\"","\"So, I was thinking...\"","Sheng Mumu paused and suddenly stood up, imitating a classic movie scene by pretending to lift the table.","\"...if it's too difficult, then let's not do it.\"","Her imitation was so lifelike that Qi Mo couldn't help but suppress a smile, and a deep amusement glimmered in his eyes.","While he found it amusing, he didn't join her in her madness.","He sat lazily on the edge of the bed, reaching out to pull her delicate wrist, his voice gentle, \"I'll take care of the arrangements. You don't have to worry about anything, you won't get tired.\"","\"You may not know,\" Sheng Mumu shook her arm as if explaining something new to an old-fashioned person, \"but nowadays, young people find those traditional and lengthy wedding procedures quite bothersome. It would be best if we could receive the cash gifts, give out the wedding favors, and bid farewell with a smile.\"","\"In fact, this has given rise to a particularly fast wedding format.\"","\"The bride and groom stand in one spot while the guests take photos. After the photos, they are given vouchers for a five-star restaurant buffet, and they can go to eat whenever they want, without any time constraints.\"","The man tilted his head back, his pitch-black eyes narrowing slightly, as if seriously considering the feasibility of this plan.","After just a few seconds, he shook his head.","\"That won't do.\"","It was just too casual and too simple.","It would be too unfair to her.","Sheng Mumu could tell that Qi Mo was contemplating something. She sat down next to him and spoke slowly:","\"I just suddenly thought of this idea; I didn't really mean to do it.\"","Qi Mo subtly let out a sigh of relief upon hearing her words.","If she insisted, he wouldn't refuse.","Sheng Mumu said, \"So let's compromise. We won't consider anything too complicated or rushed. We'll have a simple and casual wedding.\"","Qi Mo didn't understand and moved his hand to her waist, gently caressing it, as he humbly asked, \"What does 'simple and casual' mean?\"","Sheng Mumu tilted her head, raising an eyebrow, and began to fantasize.","\"A small gathering with a few close friends, having a few drinks.\"","\"Then, we'll bid them farewell and directly head off on our honeymoon, having fun for three to five months.\"","\"What do you think? Can my 'simple and casual' plan pass your review, President Qi?\"","As she spoke, her eyes were bright, clear, and soft. Qi Mo couldn't express his specific feelings; he only felt that the air around him became light and fragrant.","Looking into her eyes was like seeing countless stars.","Qi Mo gazed back at her.","His deep eyes revealed an unabashed love.","This wedding plan seemed tailor-made for her.","It was free and romantic.","Qi Mo tightened his grip on her and pulled her into his embrace.","With a low voice filled with a playful tone, he said, \"Very well.\"","As he finished speaking, he leaned closer.","Imitating Sheng Mumu, he playfully rubbed his prominent nose against her petite nose, saying with indulgence, \"Approved. Seal the plan with a stamp.\"","*","The two reached an agreement and temporarily didn't tell Qi Shaobai about the plan to have a belated wedding.","For now, nothing was more important to the third-year students than their exam preparations.","As the countdown numbers grew smaller day by day.","Sheng Mumu also became anxious, checking the time more frequently than Qi Shaobai.","But she didn't let her nervousness show on her face, trying her best to appear unconcerned about the countdown to the college entrance exams.","Every time she appeared in front of Qi Shaobai, she always had a relaxed expression.","She shared with him the latest silly news she had come across and dragged him to the gym for exercise to stay active.","Everything seemed normal on the surface.","But the perceptive young man still noticed their hidden concern and carefulness in the details.","For example, when they passed by his room, they would deliberately tread lightly.","Sheng Mumu had been looking forward to a band variety show for a long time, often mentioning that she would order a lot of takeout and wait for it to start on time in front of the TV.","Recently, she stopped mentioning it, knowing that Qi Shaobai also enjoyed watching the show, she reluctantly said:","\"Little Qi, let's watch it from the beginning to the finals after you finish your exams. That will be more enjoyable.\"","Qi Shaobai smiled and nodded, saying, \"Okay.\"","He didn't expose her.","He clearly remembered that she had said before that competitive variety shows were more interesting to watch in real-time.","Qi Shaobai could easily recall one or two instances of such small things.","As a young man who wasn't good at expressing his emotions in words, he turned the warmth he received into motivation.","He studied hard.","Not only the homeroom teacher and classmates of Class 12, even students from other grades noticed that the charismatic Qi Shaobai was different from before.","The handsome young man still had a cool and piercing gaze.","However, it no longer exudes the untamed and untamed wildness as before.","Instead, it relies on a powerful inner strength and bursts forth with branches and tendrils.","Continuously nourished, it reaches towards the sky.","Gathering strength, sprouting.","Soon, it will soar into the clouds."]},{"number":215,"title":"Chapter 215: Love (The Finale)","paragraphs":["June 7th.","Birds fluttered past the branches, waking the morning.","The lingering chill in the air was soon warmed by the sunshine.","On the usually jammed roads in Beijing city during rush hour, the blaring of car horns urging people to move was unusually absent.","The radio in the taxi was playing, and the broadcaster gently reminded parents to avoid congested routes and relax their mood.","Outside the school gates, crowds of people lined the streets.","Parents held their children's breakfast in hand, hoping they would eat their fill while worrying that eating too much would make their heads fuzzy.","A black sedan pulled up and three people stepped out, merging into the crowds.","Qi Shaobai was holding a clear file folder containing his exam permit and stationery. His dad and stepmom had already taken turns double checking it on the drive over.","As soon as Sheng Mumu got out of the car, she turned and held out her palm to Qi Mo.","Qi Shaobai looked over in confusion.","He saw his dad in a suit suddenly take two red hair ties out of his pocket and hand them to his stepmother.","Qi Shaobai: \"???\"","Disregarding the eyes of the people around her, Sheng Mumu tied one of the hair ties around her forehead.","She then crooked a finger at the strong and steady handsome man beside her.","Qi Mo obligingly bent down.","Sheng Mumu stood on her toes to slick back the fringe on his forehead and tied on an identical headband. She looked him up and down satisfingly and stroked her chin as she commented:","\"Not only still handsome as ever, but actually look younger too!\"","Qi Mo's body stiffened slightly as he slowly straightened back up.","Qi Shaobai finally made out the words on the red hair ties - \"Go Qi Shaobai!\"","The words were bold and forceful, vigorous strokes.","He recognized it as his dad's handwriting.","Qi Shaobai was shocked.","His pupils quaked epically.","Any silly antics from Sheng Mumu he would expect as par for the course.","What was unbelievable was his dad actually going along with it too.","Before he could recover from the shock, a pat landed on his shoulder.","He turned to see Sheng Mumu cock a proud brow at him.","\"Young Mr. Qi, enough fanfare for ya? Feeling pumped up and motivated?\"","\"I...uh...\" Qi Shaobai was momentarily struck dumb, not knowing how to respond. After a long pause he opened his mouth, \"Enough-\"","\"Not enough!\" Sheng Mumu cut him off mysteriously with a smile.","Qi Shaobai was perplexed: \"?\"","From the corner of his eye he caught his dad's raised brow corners sweep over the surrounding crowd, looking as if he knew what was going to happen next.","Qi Shaobai felt a throb at his temple, vaguely uneasy.","If even his perpetually collected and nonchalant dad found whatever was coming amusing enough to be conscious of drawing public attention, what could it possibly be?","Qi Shaobai brought his gaze back to Sheng Mumu's unfathomably mysterious eyes.","Suddenly, Sheng Mumu raised a finger to poke Qi Shaobai between the brows.","In the exaggerated tone of a manga character, eyes narrowed, she declared:","\"Brave youth who harbors the star power of Wen Qu! Go forth, reveal your powers to the world! I will assist you with my magical abilities, propelling you to take first place in one fell swoop!\"","Qi Shaobai: \"......\"","Qi Shaobai was utterly confused.","Staring cross-eyed at the finger still pressing into his forehead, his mind blanked.","He didn't know whether he should dodge away.","Even less did he know how he should respond.","Surprised voices arose from the people around them. The closest was a young couple, and the woman's eyes lit up, \"Oho, that's a way...\"","\"C'mere Zhaonan, mama will give you a little boost too.\"","\"Boost? Ma, I gotta get into the exam hall already, stop trying to crit me-\"","Wei Zhaonan turned his head and happened to see the frozen Qi Shaobai. His voice abruptly softened.","Realizing what his mom meant by \"boost\", he burst into hearty laughter, eyes squeezing out tears.","\"Qi...pfft...ahahaha...\"","Wei Zhaonan saw the words on Qi Mo and Sheng Mumu's foreheads and laughed even harder. In an admiring tone at their similar flair he called out, \"Uncle, Auntie, your headbands are so cool!!!\"","Qi Shaobai swallowed and threw his good friend a sharp glance.","Inhale deeply...","So embarrassing.","Yet strangely, underneath the mortification he actually felt a subtle sense of being pumped with motivation.","He must've watched too many anime lately for his chuunibyou syndrome to be this advanced.","Before long, the chuuni spirit proved contagious.","The previously grave atmosphere outside the exam hall instantly lightened.","Parents could be continually seen pumping fists to cheer their children on, using spirited language to encourage:","\"Go for it!\"","\"Conquer the exam hall!\"","The security guard pulled the doors open, announcing examinees could start entering the exam venue.","A din arose from the crowds as people started shuffling forward.","Qi Shaobai rubbed the back of his neck shyly.","Suddenly he grabbed his dad and stepmom's hands.","Stacking all three palms together with his on top.","In a clear ringing voice:","\"I'll do my best!\"","Then slowly raised his head, lowering his volume:","\"I love you guys.\"","The sunshine was just right, breeze perfectly mild.","The boy retracted his hands, cocked his chin, broke into laughter.","Casually turning away, he raced into the exam hall.","His straight back figure was jaunty and dauntless.","The fragrant cedars on campus sliced the dazzling rays into flickering spots of light.","Paved onto the road ahead he was going to tread.","Behind him, the man pulled the woman into his embrace by the shoulders.","\"If memory serves, it's Little Qi's first time saying something so cheesy right?\" Sheng Mumu suddenly asked as she looked up.","Qi Mo: \"Yes, the first time.\"","\"It really wasn't easy getting that boy to say something like this.\" Sheng Mumu smiled tenderly as a mother, her hand unconsciously coming to rest at the man's waist in light support. There was a hint of smugness in her tone, \"Thanks to me you get to hear it this first time.\"","The man's gaze darkened slightly as he turned to look at her.","After a long silence, a scorching deep bass slid past her ears.","\"Sheng Mumu, I love you.\""]},{"number":216,"title":"Chapter 216: [Closing Remarks and a Few bits and Pieces on the subject]","paragraphs":["Finally finished writing!!!!!!","As I typed the last three characters “End of main text”, my heart was pounding uncontrollably.","Then came the hard-to-put-in-words feeling of reluctance.","From when I wrote the first word of this book until now, the characters of Sheng Mumu, Old Qi, Little Qi have been slowly shaped as the story progressed.","I always feel that they seem to really exist, just living in a different space-time from me.","Choosing the “gaokao (college entrance exam)” node as the ending point for the whole story was a decision I made early on.","When Little Qi enters the exam hall, it draws the ending mark of a story.","When he comes out of the exam hall, another story is about to start.","That would be a story they orchestrate themselves in another space-time.","Alright, since I’ll still be writing extra chapters, I won’t ramble on too much.","For a period of time afterwards, extra chapters will be dropped irregularly. I hope I can achieve the small goal of reaching 500,000 words.","Some plot points I’m planning to include in the extra chapters are:","Why Qi likes eating malt candy","It rained a stream-of-consciousness in Beijing again","Wedding","The return of Sheng Mumu’s diary","Sheng Mumu’s perspective of the Qi Shaobai-Chi Xia storyline, and her mother-in-law identity getting exposed","That’s all I can think of for now. I’ll add more in if I get any sudden inspirations afterwards.","[Some issues readers have been concerned about]","1. Does Qi Shaobai know he’s not a biological child?","A: I don’t plan to specifically write about it, leaving space for imagination (definitely not because I don’t know how to write it, *cough cough*) You can understand that Old Qi treats Qi Shaobai completely as his own child when raising him, and the two have a tacit understanding that there is no need to specifically explain this issue. Or you can also understand that when Qi Shaobai grows up, he discovers his birth origins in the book he stars in, but by then it’s no longer important because the regrets of his childhood have been healed. Whether he knows his origins or not won’t affect the relationship between their family of three.","2. Will you write about Sheng Mumu having a baby?","A: I will, I didn’t want to speed up the storyline too quickly in the main text so I plan to put it in the extras. But I won’t write it too soon, it’ll probably be placed at the very end.","Little spoiler—Since there’s already little Qi, Sheng Mumu and Old Qi both want a daughter.","3. Why did the transmigration happen? Where did the original owner go?","A: In order for Sheng Mumu to have a god’s eye view, transmigration is a more common and lazy setup. I won’t delve into the full scientific principles behind transmigration (mainly because I can’t come up with it anyway), just take it as a fantastical journey alright? What can be confirmed is, Sheng Mumu will definitely spend her lifetime here with Old Qi.","So where did the original owner go?","My original thought was, parallel worlds. When Sheng Mumu transmigrated into the book world, the original owner of the book world transmigrated in reverse into the real world, became healed by the parents and friends of real-world Sheng Mumu, started another phase of life, fulfilling Sheng Mumu’s wish of taking care of her parents, and met the right person eventually.","But I worry that because they’re both “Sheng Mumu” stories there would be confusion. I haven’t decided if I want to write it as an extra special chapter yet, depends on inspiration and state."]},{"number":217,"title":"Chapter 217: Xiao Ba General (1)","paragraphs":["After the exams were over, Jing City No.1 Middle School organized two rounds of score estimation.","The first round involved a strict comparison of answers to estimate the lowest possible score, while the second round used a more relaxed approach to estimate the best ideal score. Finally, the average of the two scores was taken to obtain a relatively objective score.","The good news was that even according to the results of the first round of estimation, Qi Shaobai's score exceeded the admission cutoff of his ideal college last year.","He immediately shared this news with Sheng Mumu.","Within seconds of sending the message, Sheng Mumu called him.","The call connected.","Sheng Mumu's excited voice came through the invisible waves.","She asked, \"Where are you now?\"","Qi Shaobai replied, \"I just left the school and I'm preparing to go home.\"","\"Wait before you leave. I'll come to find you.\"","Qi Shaobai asked with confusion, \"?\"","Sheng Mumu, in a hurry, spoke while already picking up her bag and leaving the office.","She reminded Qi Shaobai, \"Don't wait foolishly at the school gate. Let's meet at the Red Bean Ice Cream Shop on the back street of your school. We can wait there and enjoy the air conditioning.\"","Qi Shaobai instinctively replied, \"Alright.\" He was about to ask why she was coming over, but before he could speak, he heard Sheng Mumu's voice again.","\"By the way, we're in a hurry. I won't get off the car. Please buy a bag of maltose candy for your dad.\"","As soon as she finished speaking, Qi Shaobai heard Sheng Mumu complaining about the poor elevator signal, exchanged a few hurried words, and then the call ended.","Qi Shaobai was momentarily stunned.","In a rush?","Where did she plan to take him?","He was completely puzzled.","However, he obediently changed direction and walked toward the back gate of the school.","Sheng Mumu's company was not close to Jing City No.1 Middle School. Under normal traffic conditions, it usually took about twenty minutes to get there.","But today, the minute hand had just passed the third tick mark.","Fifteen minutes.","A red Porsche appeared in front of the Red Bean Ice Cream Shop.","Qi Shaobai got into the car, holding two bags in his hands.","He fastened his seatbelt and placed the bag of maltose candy on the back seat, then handed the other bag to Sheng Mumu.","\"Here, I packed the red bean ice cream for you.\"","He remembered that the last time Sheng Mumu came to his school, she had eaten two bowls of red bean ice cream at this shop.","It wasn't even summer at that time, yet she could eat so much ice cream.","It was evident that she really liked it.","While waiting for her at the Red Bean Ice Cream Shop, he naturally thought of packing a portion for her.","Sheng Mumu's eyes lit up.","She reached out and pinched Qi Shaobai's cheek.","Her tone was both motherly and exaggerated.","\"Qi Shaobai, you are so thoughtful and filial~\"","Qi Shaobai, being praised, showed an expression of \"Do you have to be so exaggerated?\" and leaned his head back, avoiding her.","While Sheng Mumu quickly ate the red bean ice cream, he finally had the chance to ask:","\"Where are we going? Why are we in a hurry?\"","Sheng Mumu mysteriously narrowed her eyes and teased:","\"Don't ask. In any case, it's a place where you won't be disappointed. You'll find out very soon.\"","After saying that, she raised her hand and made a motion of zipping her lips.","She didn't reveal another word and buried her head in eating the red bean ice cream.","Qi Shaobai: \"...\"","After a year of being together, Qi Shaobai was already quite familiar with Sheng Mumu's style.","Even the simplest activities like grocery shopping, taking a stroll after dinner, or trying out new restaurants can be described by her in a way that fills one with anticipation.","He didn't ask any further questions and quietly played the role of a good eldest brother.","Patiently waiting for Sheng Mumu to finish her red bean ice, he dutifully cleaned up the trash and threw it away when they got off the car.","They drove the red Porsche towards the outskirts of Jing City for about forty minutes, and the surrounding high-rise buildings became fewer and fewer.","When Qi Shaobai's gaze inadvertently swept over, he suddenly froze upon seeing the entrance gate of University of Science and Technology Jing City ahead.","Surprised, his voice slightly delayed as he asked, \"How did... you know...\"","\"Know what?\" Sheng Mumu smiled and took over the conversation, parking the car at the entrance of the University of Science and Technology Jing City. She looked up at the bright sun outside, furrowing her brows slightly, and took out sunglasses from her glasses case. As if she already knew, she playfully asked, \"Do you know that this is the school you want to apply to?\"","Qi Shaobai slowly nodded, his doubts not yet dispelled.","He had never mentioned his desire to attend University of Science and Technology Jing City to anyone.","It had always been buried in his heart, silently striving for it.","How did she know?","Sheng Mumu had a petite face, and with half of it covered by sunglasses, she pressed the frame with one finger, nodding slightly and raising her eyebrows. In a leisurely tone, she said, \"What a little kid thinks, us adults can guess with just one look. It's not just me; your dad also knew long ago that your dream school is here.\"","Last night, she had a conversation with Qi Mo.","They chatted about betting and guessing which school Qi Shaobai wanted to apply to.","She had prior knowledge of a small part of the plot in the book, possessing a god's perspective.","She knew that Qi Shaobai had always admired his father, who made his first bucket of gold by selling self-written programs, and had set his sights on studying software engineering.","Among the top universities in Jing City, the software engineering program at University of Science and Technology Jing City was the most famous.","When she proudly said, \"I guess it's University of Science and Technology Jing City,\" the people around her also echoed with the three words \"University of Science and Technology Jing City.\"","She was momentarily stunned, but seeing Qi Mo's faint smile, she said in a deep voice, \"If Qi Shaobai can score high enough, he will probably choose to come here.\"","\"If\"... \"probably\"...","Qi Mo's choice of words was not absolute, but his eyes and eyebrows revealed unwavering confidence, a look of complete certainty.","Sheng Mumu immediately searched for the admission scores of University of Science and Technology Jing City over the years.","When she received the estimated score message from Qi Shaobai today, she happily jumped up from her chair and exclaimed, \"Yes!\"","Unless something unexpected happens, his scores should be enough to meet the cutoff.","The idea of bringing Qi Shaobai to visit his dream school almost instantly came to her mind.","Standing in front of the entrance gate of University of Science and Technology Jing City, Qi Shaobai's emotions were complex.","There was a faint longing and excitement, as well as a mix of trust and doubt about Sheng Mumu's words.","Is it really true?","He's eighteen, not eight.","Is it so obvious what he's thinking, written all over his face for everyone to see?","He wanted to become a man like his father, who remained calm and unreadable, with a mysterious and composed demeanor.","He thought it was really cool.","But... it seemed like he was getting further away from that goal.","He was nothing like his father at all.","\"What are you standing there for? Let's go, and explore the school where you'll spend the next four years.\"","Sheng Mumu's urging voice interrupted his thoughts.","Qi Shaobai took a step forward, smiled happily, and modestly said, \"I may not necessarily pass the exam. My estimated score might not be accurate.\"","Although the estimated score was good, he didn't dare to be too happy until the actual results were released.","Clap—","Someone patted Qi Shaobai on the back.","He turned around and saw Sheng Mumu frowning at him.","With a complaining tone, she said, \"You, just like your father, always act so cautious and cunning. You pretend to be modest and humble, but deep down, you're cautious and sly, leaving yourself an escape route.\"","Qi Shaobai was stunned by the scolding. \"...\"","Sheng Mumu thought that Qi Shaobai's expression just now was exactly the same as Qi Mo's last night.","Indeed, under the influence of Old President, the Young President is gradually taking shape.","Sigh.","Sheng Mumu sighed lightly, shook her head, and continued walking ahead.","Qi Shaobai followed behind her with his hands in his pockets, touring the campus of the University of Science and Technology Jing City.","After a while, Sheng Mumu casually glanced back and saw Qi Shaobai's naturally gloomy face with an expression that could be described as \"excited.\"","Sheng Mumu: Confused.gif","What is this kid smiling about?","Could it be that he thought she just praised him?","What exactly is he so excited about?"]},{"number":218,"title":"Chapter 218: Xiao Ba Zong (2)","paragraphs":["This trip to Beijing University of Technology further strengthened Qi Shaobai's determination to make it his first choice for college.","Half a month later, it was time to check the exam scores. The whole family gathered in the living room.","Qi Shaobai sat in the middle of the sofa, with a laptop in front of him. The screen was on the score checking page, just waiting for the clock to hit 9 AM to refresh and login.","On one side, Grandma and Feng Yaoqin held hands tightly. Grandma was very nervous but didn't want to stress Qi Shaobai out, so she kept repeating with a smile, \"Our little one will definitely be fine.\"","Qiao Li and Cheng Zhuo also came to witness Qi Shaobai's glorious moment. They stood behind the sofa, anxiously watching the clock get closer and closer to 9 AM.","On the other side of the sofa, Sheng Mumu had long since turned on the video recording function on her phone, with the lens aimed at Qi Shaobai.","In previous years, one could always see many excited college entrance exam score checking videos being shared on social media.","In some videos, everyone would be teary-eyed with excitement, with sounds of cheer filling the room.","In others, the student would jump a meter high in excitement, running around the house.","There were also some where the student would go weak-kneed with excitement, having to hold on to a chair as their legs shook, unable to stand up.","Thinking back on those videos she had seen, Sheng Mumu's eyes lit up with anticipation.","She zoomed the phone camera in even closer to Qi Shaobai with her fingers. She wanted to know if Qi Shaobai would have some sort of primal reaction if he checked and found a good score.","Like making monkey sounds, rolling around on the floor, or doing somersaults.","She could hardly wait.","She absolutely could not miss a single moment.","She must completely document future CEO Qi Shaobai's embarrassing past.","Keep it for when they're old, sitting in rocking chairs, having a good laugh~","Qi Mo sat next to Sheng Mumu, his arm draped over the back of the sofa behind her. Seeing a stray lock of hair falling over her eyes, he reached out and tucked it behind her ear.","He casually asked, \"How much longer?\"","\"Ten more seconds,\" Sheng Mumu answered quickly without looking up, seemingly afraid of missing the time. She shushed him, signaling for him not to speak first.","Then, speaking into her phone camera:","\"Look closely now, this man is called Little Qi—\"","\"...\"","Qi Mo was a bit stunned, amused by her narration, struggling not to laugh out loud.","He wanted to laugh but was afraid the noise would disrupt her filming.","So he picked up his coffee cup and took a sip to divert his attention.","Qi Mo was not worried at all about Qi Shaobai's score.","Last night before bed, Sheng Mumu had checked Qi Shaobai's estimated score with him several times.","He had calculated that as long as there were no major scoring mistakes, Qi Shaobai's actual score should be 10-13 points higher than estimated.","Finally, the clock struck 9 AM.","Under everyone's watchful gaze, Qi Shaobai entered his login credentials.","His face was expressionless, his hands steady, his composure unruffled.","Only the tense line of his jaw betrayed his inner anxiety.","Page loading...","The air seemed to freeze for a moment.","The next second—","A clear cry of excitement sounded through the living room.","Qiao Li and Cheng Zhuo leaned over the sofa back and excitedly clapped Qi Shaobai on the shoulders.","As the lead singer of a band, Qiao Li's voice carried exceptionally well.","And was exceptionally infectious.","Even Zhang Housekeeper and the others standing a bit further back could ascertain the good news from this cheer. Their faces relaxed with relief.","Zhang Housekeeper clenched his fist and waved it slightly, \"Well done Young Master!\"","Grandma and Feng Yaoqin, still holding hands, swung their arms joyfully, happiness written all over the wrinkles around their eyes.","However, compared to everyone else's varied displays of delight, the main character Qi Shaobai was exceptionally calm.","A fleeting glint of elation flashed through his eyes.","But was quickly reined in.","He unhurriedly closed his laptop and said to his father, who was seated such that he couldn't see the laptop screen:","\"Dad, 653 points, 13 points higher than estimated.\"","Sheng Mumu's gaze left her phone and looked directly at Qi Shaobai.","That's it? Nothing else?","What's going on.","Why aren't you running around?","Why aren't you rolling on the floor??","You should at least howl a couple times!","So boring.","It wasn't until she turned and glanced at the other Qi surnamed man beside her that she suddenly understood.","Qi Mo's composure put Qi Shaobai's to shame. He was leisurely setting down his coffee cup, his long, elegant fingers adjusting his expensive watch, glancing up to give Qi Shaobai a slight nod.","His deep voice was calm and steady:","\"Mm, well done.\"","Sheng Mumu heaved a resigned sigh, \"...\"","Alright, Qi Shaobai was badly afflicted with father complex.","As long as Qi Mo was present, no matter how excited Qi Shaobai was, no matter how much he wanted to beat his chest and roar, he would hold it in.","Putting on a mature, steady demeanor, matching his listless father.","Sheng Mumu directed her frustration at not capturing Qi Shaobai's primal reaction footage at Qi Mo instead.","That night before bed, she was still lamenting the loss. She couldn't help kicking the man lying next to her who was flipping through a financial magazine.","Irritably, she said, \"What's with you big boss types, would it kill you to be more cheerful and lively? Smiling at your kid more won't land you in jail, Mr. Qi.\"","The kicked man turned to look at her, stunned for a few seconds.","Then, relying on their long-built rapport to understand what she was blaming him for, he immediately expressed remorse.","\"It's all my fault.\"","For causing her to miss recording such an interesting moment.","\"Of course it's your fault!\" Sheng Mumu felt completely justified. She continued to berate him, \"Qi Shaobai's been influenced by you too, acting all old before his time at just 18.\"","Qi Mo's expression froze almost imperceptibly.","He closed his magazine, pulling her into his arms.","In a soothing tone he said,","\"Don't be angry—\"","He stopped mid-sentence, a smile spreading across his lips as he looked directly at Sheng Mumu.","\"From now on, I'll smile like this, okay?\"","Sheng Mumu's pupils shook.","She couldn't help bursting into laughter.","Her belly full of resentment dissipated in an instant.","The sight before her was just too amusing.","Qi Mo's current appearance was exceptionally comical.","The corners of his lips were lifted, the planes of his face strained upwards.","He was trying his utmost to present a cheerful, open laugh free of weariness and age.","A bungled effort from a handsome man was a rare sight indeed.","Not exactly ruined but still somehow sorrowful to look at.","It was the first time she had seen him laugh so brilliantly.","An inexplicable sense of discordance.","\"Stop laughing. You look worse than crying,\" Sheng Mumu poked his face, laughing as she called for him to stop, \"It's my mistake, I shouldn't have put you on the spot. Go back to normal.\"","But Qi Mo not only didn't restrain himself, his smile deepened instead.","His chiseled, refined brows lifted with the breadth of his smile, a glint shining in his pitch black pupils.","Deliberately teasing her, he asked, \"What about this? Is this better?\"","Sheng Mumu swept him a glance, laughing until her cheeks ached.","She pushed his face away with her hand.","\"Really annoying, cut it out!\"","Despite her reproachful words, Sheng Mumu's soft, cottony voice robbed them of any real blame.","Qi Mo moved back in as she pushed him away, pulling her into his embrace. His satisfied, blissful smile was back.","Then some days later—","Sheng Mumu spent an entire afternoon tea pondering Qi Mo's juvenile behavior that night, as well as Qi Shaobai's pretense of maturity.","She eventually concluded—abnormality is normality after all.","In TV shows and novels, domineering CEOs would usually have some unknown quirks.","For Qi Mo it was occasional childishness, loving malted candy.","For Qi Shaobai it showed in his severe father complex, deliberately feigning composure in front of his father despite his arrogant tsundere personality.","Having realized this, Sheng Mumu no longer dwelled on it.","She candidly accepted that she would be spending her long future days together with these two atypical domineering CEOs."]},{"number":219,"title":"Chapter 219: Qi Shaobai (1)","paragraphs":["During the last summer vacation before university, Qi Shaobai was living a carefree life.","Some days he would stay in his room the whole time, intensely building Lego models for eight or nine hours straight.","Other times he would call up Wei Zhaonan to go out and play basketball together.","His uncle Cheng Xin, who lived abroad, had invited him to travel to the United States and visit his Lego collection with nearly a thousand different sets.","When Cheng Xin called, Qi Shaobai happened to be playing video games with his younger uncle Cheng Zhuo.","During this time, Cheng Zhuo came over with new video games every few days for Qi Shaobai to \"compare skills\", although it was more like a challenge.","As citizen Sheng Mumu walked by the living room, she saw the “Game Over” screen appear on Qi Shaobai’s side for what seemed like the nth time. She generously expressed her praise:","“Little Qi has superb talent in video games, as expected of my good boy.”","At the same time, she gave some tactful encouragement to Cheng Zhuo:","“Noob, keep it up - aren't you embarrassed to lose to Qi Shaobai? Hmm?\"","Qi Shaobai: \"...\"","Cheng Zhuo: \"...\"","When it came to rendering two people speechless with just a few sentences, Sheng Mumu was undoubtedly very skilled.","Before the two could come up with a retort, Sheng Mumu was already clip-clopping out the door in her high heels, leaving behind a beautiful silhouette and a faint scent of perfume lingering in the air.","Qi Shaobai helplessly lowered his eyes halfway, gazing silently at the door.","A sigh.","She went out to play again without him.","He really wanted to complain - a certain someone had been especially close with a certain Miss Sheng lately!","The two visibly spent less time at work in the past week. At least three days they didn't come home for dinner, going out on dates to eat and watch movies every day instead.","It was as if the ones enjoying summer vacation and about to start university were them instead of Qi Shaobai, who had just received his admission notice.","Qi Shaobai’s resentment only lingered over his head for a little while before his attention was drawn away by the opening music of the next game.","The two were playing a multiplayer real-time strategy game. Players had to gather resources and build forces to destroy the opponent.","Qi Shaobai lazily sat cross-legged on the carpet and started showing off his professional-level control. Cheng Zhuo was so shocked that he stared blankly again and again.","At the end of the game, Cheng Zhuo gritted his teeth and said, \"You've already secured a win this round - why did you have to ruthlessly slaughter me?\"","Qi Shaobai laughed. \"We’re brothers, so of course I have to slaughter you.\"","Cheng Zhuo was so angry that his eyes rolled back. \"Get the seniority straight. I'm your uncle.\"","\"Next round, if you win, I'll call you Uncle one thousand times instead of just one hundred.\"","\"Come on then, I won't believe I can’t win!”","That’s how the whole summer break went by very quickly.","It wasn’t until three days before University of Science and Technology Jing City notified new students to report that Qi Shaobai belatedly realized summer was almost over.","In previous years, the start of each school year was always the lowest point emotionally.","But this year felt different from past years.","Firstly, because he had been admitted to his dream university.","Secondly, he had asked his dad and stepmother in advance - they said they would accompany him on the day of report in.","It was pretty sad. He had finished nine years of compulsory education but this was the first time experiencing having his parents take him to enroll in school.","University of Science and Technology Jing City gave new first year students four days to report in.","Qi Shaobai had originally intended to go on the fourth day.","He disliked crowds and noise. Just imagining the crowded campus scene those first two days gave him a headache.","But when he had just suggested \"go on the last day\", he was glared into submission by a look from Sheng Mumu.","\"Are you silly? If you wait until the fourth day, you’d have completely lost the dorm selection priority. The early bird gets the worm, understand?\"","She had researched in advance - University of Science and Technology Jing City didn't allocate dorms by class number. It was first come first serve, mixed between departments.","The official reason was: to promote friendly exchanges and mutual improvement between students of different departments.","After some thought, Qi Shaobai agreed that what Sheng Mumu said made a lot of sense.","Just as Sheng Mumu had found out, Qi Shaobai’s early arrival allowed him to choose a very nice dorm room.","University of Science and Technology Jing City was built on the shore of Jing City’s largest inland lake. Living lakeside had the advantages of beautiful scenery and tranquility, but also the drawback of pestering mosquitoes.","Arriving early meant luckily choosing a building just a few hundred meters from the lakefront trail where he could enjoy the beautiful view without being in the worst mosquito area.","The various mosquito repellent sprays and anti-itch ointments Sheng Mumu had prepared in advance ended up not needed.","What’s more, his other three dorm mates were all very easy to get along with.","In Sheng Mumu's words: “Little Qi, based on my initial observations, your three roommates are all extroverts. This is great. Even if you wanted to isolate yourself as an introvert, they would drag you out to socialize. How reassuring!\"","Qi Shaobai was speechless for a moment: \"...\"","After settling in and finishing all the enrollment procedures, it happened to be 5 pm.","Watching the sun gradually sinking, it seemed Sheng Mumu suddenly thought of something as her eyes slowly lit up.","Qi Shaobai was extremely familiar with her subtle expressions. With just a glance, he understood what she had in mind.","The corners of his mouth curled up slightly as he said in a deep voice:","\"It's still early now that Qi Shaobai has finished enrolling. There's no hurry to go back.\"","Qi Shaobai thought his dad wanted to find a restaurant near the school for the three of them to have dinner together. His pleasant anticipation had just risen halfway when he suddenly heard Sheng Mumu's voice:","\"I was thinking the exact same thing. If we go now, we might still be able to catch the sunset.\"","Qi bent down his head in acknowledgement. “Okay, I’ll drive faster.”","Qi Shaobai: ???","Setting off? To see the sunset?","Qi Shaobai was completely confused, clearly not understanding their cryptic conversation.","Only after Sheng Mumu explained a few sentences to Qi Shaobai did he suddenly realize - he was wishfully thinking again. They hadn’t planned on bringing him at all!","Sheng Mumu ignored Qi Shaobai’s slightly twitching lips. She happily pulled Qi’s outstretched arm towards the parking lot.","Less than ten minutes' drive from University of Science and Technology Jing City was a highly-rated homestay.","The top-rated comment on a certain review app said watching the sunset there makes the sun seem gentle.","Since the flower shop business had gradually gotten on track, she no longer needed to stare at the company all day. She started planning to expand the business scope.","After some investigation and discussion with Qi, she took a liking to the homestay chain project, believing it had great potential.","It just so happened they were in the area today. They could first experience it as customers.","While those two beautifully enjoyed the scenic homestay, Qi Shaobai began his first sleepless night tossing and turning in the dorm.","He was used to his own bed. Even though University of Science and Technology Jing City dorm conditions were pretty good, he still found it hard to adapt.","Adding insult to injury, the morning after he got up with dark eye circles, a senior student pushed open the dorm room door. He announced loudly to the room:","“Handsome and hardworking juniors, the report in place is short on manpower for the new female students. Come with me to show them around.”"]},{"number":220,"title":"Chapter 220: Qi Shaobai (2)","paragraphs":["The campus of University of Science and Technology Jing City was bustling with people. Among the youthful faces, a male student wearing black sweatpants stood out in particular.","Qi Shaobai was calm and composed. Carrying a suitcase in each hand, he walked at an unhurried pace, completing the task assigned by the teacher in charge of new student registration to lead the way. He pretended not to notice the infatuated looks from the girls beside him.","In fact, he had only been here one day, but thanks to his map reading skills perhaps honed by playing computer games, he had already figured out the basic campus layout of University of Science and Technology Jing City.","After a while, they arrived at the female dormitory building.","The wheels of the suitcase stopped rolling.","\"We're here. This is the place,\" Qi Shaobai said in a flat tone.","\"Thank you, senior!\"","Senior?","Qi Shaobai's expression remained unchanged, but he repeated the term to himself in his mind.","Clearly, the new female student had misunderstood him.","But he was too lazy to correct her misconception and simply said lightly, \"You're welcome.\"","Just as the girl was about to open her mouth to ask more questions with a hesitant yet eager look, he decisively turned and left, showing only his cold back.","The girl reacted swiftly to snap a photo of his side profile before Qi Shaobai turned the corner.","When she arrived at Dorm Room 205, she hadn't even introduced herself to the other three girls who had already settled in the room. Her first words were a string of exclamations.","\"Wow, wow, wow! Sisters, the senior who led me here was so handsome, so handsome, so handsome! Extremely good-looking!\"","As she finished speaking, the three other girls in the dorm involuntarily looked her way.","The girl occupying the bed next to the balcony smiled and blinked. \"Hello, sisters. I'm Chi Xia.\"","Since school hadn't officially started, the dorm supervisor didn't enforce lights out at the regular time.","The clock struck midnight, but the lights in Room 205 were still on.","Bursts of delightful laughter could be heard from time to time.","Lying in her single room, the dorm supervisor couldn't help marveling that this year's freshmen were quite talkative. On just the first day, they all seemed to have hit it off.","This was not a common occurrence in previous years.","The remarkably amicable relationship forged among the four girls in Room 205 could be entirely attributed to the two social butterflies among them.","One was Chi Xia, the other was Jian Miao, who had addressed everyone intimately as \"sisters\" the moment she entered the room today.","At Chi Xia's suggestion, the four went off campus for dinner together that night.","Over the meal, they chatted freely, still reluctant to part ways when the clock struck midnight. Following the tradition, they ranked themselves as Big Sis, Second Sis, Third Sis and Baby Sis according to their ages.","As a Jing City native, Chi Xia naturally became the others' oracle, ceaselessly answering all kinds of questions, such as: Which shopping area in Jing City is better? How cold can the winter get? There won't be cockroaches that can fly here, right?!","As their discussion was winding down, Second Sis Jian Miao blissfully heaved a long sigh. \"I'm so lucky today. Not only did I get to know you lovely girls, I also met a handsome senior who led the way. I can foresee what an enjoyable university life lies ahead!\"","Upon hearing this, Baby Sis instantly took interest. She tore open a bag of potato chips to prepare for the gossip. \"Exactly how handsome? Which department does he belong to? Does he have a girlfriend?\" She had wanted to ask these questions the moment she heard Jian Miao burst through the door saying those words this morning. But back then, they weren't yet familiar with one another so she didn't feel comfortable asking outright.","Jian Miao shook her head regretfully. \"I don't know. That handsome guy was so cold. His face was stinky. If I hadn't heard him speak at last, I might have really suspected that he was a mute. You know me, I read too many novels. When seeing such a good-looking guy, I can't help feeling that he should have some congenital flaw as a misfortune-prone character. Otherwise it wouldn't seem realistic for someone so handsome to have no defects at all.\"","Her words induced an outburst of laughter in the dorm room.","After a moment, Baby Sis eased up and said, \"Miao Miao, no pic no truth! I suspect you're exaggerating.\"","\"Who said there's no pic?\" Jian Miao immediately took out her phone and waved it mysteriously. \"I secretly snapped a shot of him.\"","\"Quick, show us!\"","When Jian Miao opened her photo album, three faces leaned in side by side.","In the picture, the \"senior\" had his hands tucked into his pockets, walking in a lazy posture, with his chin tilted up a bit.","His simple outfit could not conceal the edge that radiated from within.","His face did look stinky, with a straight line for the lips.","For some reason, he gave off a vibe of looking at the whole world with slight disdain.","He had good height and a straight nose. His side profile was smooth and his brows and eyes were profound yet permeated with a fleeting flamboyance that was hard to capture.","It was as if the light of the entire world should shine on him, but he still found it too troublesome, using his stinky face to say \"don't look at me\", giving off that kind of feeling.","Chi Xia suddenly frowned, muttering to herself, \"Senior?\"","Wasn't this the boy from Jing City No.1 Middle School?","\"Yeah,\" Jian Miao nodded. \"Handsome, right?\"","\"So handsome!\" Baby Sis nodded vigorously. \"Not ordinarily handsome, but brimming with charm. And so fair too! I'm so envious of that snow white skin!\"","Big Sis was relatively more composed, but even she couldn't help exclaiming now, \"Pretty awesome.\"","\"Big sisters can admire him, and so can little sisters!\" Baby Sis joked, mimicking lines from TV dramas.","Another round of giggles.","After the laughter died down, everyone realized Chi Xia hadn't said anything.","\"Xia Xia? Why are you zoning out? Stunned speechless by White Senior's handsomeness?\" Jian Miao asked.","Chi Xia was puzzled. \"His surname is Bai (White)?\"","Jian Miao laughed. \"I made that up randomly. He's so fair, let's call him White Senior. Fits perfectly, no?\"","Big Sis said, \"You do have a knack for nicknames.\"","Baby Sis echoed, \"Very apt.\"","Chi Xia thought to herself that if she hadn't recognized wrongly, he should be in the same grade as her.","Moreover, his surname should be Qi or Zhi.","Called Zhi Shao or Qi Shao or something similar.","How did he...become a senior?","Where exactly did the misunderstanding occur?","Harboring doubts in her heart, she didn't voice them out.","After all, it could be someone who simply resembled him in the side profile picture.","The other girls didn't dwell too much on Chi Xia's abnormal reaction. They started a new night chat about \"White Senior\", analyzing the secretly taken picture.","\"Sweet dreams fodder for tonight, got it.\"","\"But truth be told, White Senior looks too cold. Not my cup of tea. I feel I'd suffer emotional abuse from him.\"","\"Ahahaha...\"","\"Isn't taming a bristly lone wolf cub quite a rewarding challenge?!\"","\"Miao Miao, your colloquial descriptors are just so...\"","\"Hahaha, I'll tone it down a bit.\"","On the other side...","Qi Shaobai was completely oblivious that he had become the night chat topic in the female dorm.","As soon as he returned to his dorm room, two roommates eagerly crowded around him.","\"You just sent new students to East 7 Building right?\"","Faced with his roommates' eager questioning, Qi Shaobai was puzzled. He leaned his neck back and echoed flatly, \"Yeah.\"","\"I heard there's a campus belle in East 7. Did you see her when you went over?\"","\"No.\" Qi Shaobai's reply was succinct.","Roommate A scratched his head. \"That can't be right. I heard our grade's school flower is staying in the dorm building of East 7. How could you not have seen her?\"","The male and female freshmen who had just entered university were all pent up with youthful vigor. Checking out the opposite gender was the first thing on their minds upon arriving on campus.","Qi Shaobai walked to his desk, pulled back the chair, and laughed. \"It's not like she could be standing at the entrance like some mascot, right?\"","His roommate patted his own head, realizing he was being a bit foolish. \"You're right. We can take a better look during military training.\"","Qi Shaobai didn't respond.","He had no interest in this topic.","Compared to gossip, he was more concerned with the military training that would start three days later - questions like, how long is the break time during military training and how to cleverly avoid being pulled out by the officers to sing songs."]},{"number":221,"title":"Chapter 221: Qi Shaobai (3)","paragraphs":["The scorching summer had passed, but the heat had yet to relent. The oppressive heat of the Indian summer was even more dreadful than in August.","The ten-day military training had only reached its third day, and the new students were already complaining endlessly.","If it were just the physical exertion, it would be bearable.","But the real hardship was that the training grounds were located near the school's sports field, which was not far from the lake.","Before everyone could be exhausted from standing in various military postures, they were already tormented by an unbearable itch caused by the countless mosquitoes.","The mosquito repellent sprays in the small supermarket were sold out within half a day.","Only the quick ones were able to secure a bottle, while the slow ones were left empty-handed.","When Qi Shaobai's roommates invited him to go to the off-campus small supermarket to buy a new batch of mosquito repellent sprays, he wore a smug expression and said, \"I won't go. I have some already.\"","Before coming, Cheng Muxu had packed a lot of them in his luggage.","Although he said he wouldn't go, in the end, his roommates dragged him out of his seat and took him to the small supermarket.","On the other side, in the girls' dormitory building.","All the members of Room 205 were out, just like the previous three days, heading to the food street near the school gate to eat hot pot potato noodles.","The proprietress would always give them a few extra meatballs in their bowls when she saw them wearing camouflage uniforms for military training.","Food was the best comforter.","The proprietress's goodwill and the fragrant broth of the potato noodles became a soothing remedy for their arduous training.","After eating their fill and satisfying their thirst, the four of them took a stroll to aid digestion and returned to the dormitory.","As September arrived, the sky grew dark earlier than in July and August.","The clock was approaching seven o'clock, and the streetlights had not yet been lit on both sides of the road. There were many students walking on both sides of the road.","The students heading out of the school walked faster, mostly discussing the world-class problem of \"what to have for dinner.\"","The students walking into the school had a leisurely pace, mostly recommending idols, discussing the newly released movies, or gossiping about recent entertainment news.","Chi Xia and the youngest girl in the dormitory were holding hands and chatting about a variety show. Suddenly, the youngest girl stopped talking and tugged at Chi Xia's arm.","Then, she saw the youngest girl excitedly patting Jian Miao's shoulder.","\"Miao Miao! Look at the eleven o'clock direction. Isn't that the senior you took a photo of last time?\"","The eleven o'clock direction.","Qi Shaobai walked half a step behind his three roommates, with his hands in the pockets of his sweatshirt. He was walking a bit slower, closer to the inside.","As if sensing that someone was looking at him, he involuntarily glanced in the direction they were pointing.","When his gaze met a pair of familiar eyes, Qi Shaobai subtly paused.","Isn't she that girl?","In the brief moment when their eyes met, Chi Xia remembered the afternoon when they first met.","During the joint mobilization meeting for the college entrance examination held by Jing City No.1 Middle School and the girls' high school, he walked a step ahead of her on the road lined with camphor trees, pretending to be passing by and pointing her in the right direction.","Then there were the teahouse, the bookstore, and the movie theater entrance where they bumped into each other several times.","The most recent time was after the Jing City No.1 Middle School Art Festival ended, he helped her escape smoothly when she was stopped by the gatekeeper. In return, she bought him a can of grape-flavored soda.","Chi Xia became a little absent-minded.","She hadn't made a mistake. The person captured in Miao Miao's photo was indeed him.","It was too coincidental.","It was so uncanny that she almost felt it had a supernatural quality.","Qi Shaobai had changed from before.","Perhaps influenced by a certain guardian at home, the once black-and-white world now had vibrant colors.","He was no longer immersed in his own world, nor was he as stubborn and unsympathetic as before.","For instance, in the past, even if his roommate tried to persuade and drag him, he would never go to the supermarket.","But today, he felt that a collective dormitory activity was not a bad idea.","Similarly, in the past, even if he encountered a classmate on the road, he would only give a casual glance without greeting.","But now...","He stopped in his tracks, and his chin lifted slightly. At that exact moment, the clock struck seven o'clock.","The dimly lit road suddenly lit up as streetlights on both sides turned on in an instant.","A warm yellow light descended from above, casting a soft glow on his handsome face.","With broad shoulders, having taken a quick shower before leaving, he wasn't wearing the camouflage uniform for military training.","The edge of his black T-shirt collar still had water stains from wet hair, and there was a hint of surprise and contentment at the corners of his mouth as he looked at the girl just across a small path.","His voice was still annoying.","\"Hey, directionally challenged girl, it's you again. You're also at this school?\"","In just a few seconds, Chi Xia's arm was almost shaken into a blur by her three roommates.","They didn't say a word, but their eye contact and body language spoke volumes.","They were amazed at how Xia Xia knew \"Senior Bai\"!","They couldn't contain their expressions of curiosity.","Chi Xia took a shallow breath.","With people coming and going, and Qi Shaobai speaking loudly, she noticed several people looking in their direction.","She knew she wasn't good at finding her way, but she was trying her best to overcome this flaw.","For this registration, she deliberately refused her parents' company, familiarized herself with the layout of the University of Science and Technology Jing City campus in advance, came to register alone, didn't ask anyone to show her the way, and completed all the registration procedures!","She had made so much progress, yet she was being called directionally challenged.","She was annoyed!","After a while, Chi Xia finally pursed her lips and looked over, not in a good mood.","The three boys opposite, apart from Qi Shaobai, looked at each other.","To avoid misunderstandings, Chi Xia called out their names, in a tone that was far from polite.","\"Qi Shao, who are you calling directionally challenged?\"","Qi Shaobai's brow twitched.","Confused.jpg","Qi Shaobai's roommate A: \"You still have a stage name, huh?\"","Qi Shaobai's roommate B: \"Qi Shaobai, you dare to say you haven't seen the top beauty before! You've even exchanged greetings, you move fast!\" (Gritting teeth in secret.jpg)","Chi Xia's roommate: \"So Senior Bai's surname is Qi (suddenly realizing, stroking chin)\"","*","As they say, coincidences make for a good story.","Under a series of coincidences, the two of them seemed to have developed a certain understanding, so encountering each other in various situations no longer felt strange.","During military training, when lining up at the cafeteria, attending dull seminars at the university activity center...","Even the seniors and senior sisters who were recruiting new members for clubs happened to bring the two of them together under the same roof to fill out forms.","Again and again.","They could always find each other almost at first glance amid the vast crowd.","With time, a sense of familiarity grew.","The previous misunderstanding was finally resolved, and they also learned each other's real names.","Gradually, the two of them went from merely brushing past each other and nodding in acknowledgement to occasionally having a few more conversations.","\"Are you going to class?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"Is the cafeteria crowded?\"","\"Very crowded. Today, Aunt Rong is in charge of cooking, and the portion size is at least reduced by half. I suggest you go to the second cafeteria.\"","\"What elective course did you sign up for?\"","\"Traditional culture, taught by Teacher Fang Jun. How about you?\"","\"Teacher Fang? He's really impressive.\"","\"Oh, is that so? That's great.\"","\"He's really accurate with his three-point shots.\"","\"...Is that what you mean by 'impressive'?\"","\"Yeah, what else would you think?\"","\"...Never mind.\"","Qi Shaobai was the type who seemed aloof when you didn't know him, but once you got to know him, he gradually revealed his sarcastic and mischievous side.","Chi Xia, on the other hand, was the opposite—outwardly warm but inwardly cold.","When they weren't very familiar with each other, she was the queen of topics and a spokesperson for optimism. Many people's first impression of her was as a \"sweet girl.\"","Only those who were familiar with her knew that she wasn't a typical sweet girl at heart.","Influenced by her gentle and humble father, she smiled at everyone and could have conversations without burden, ensuring that the conversation never fell flat.","Also influenced by her mother's strong and capable personality, she chose to study management and wanted to become a successful woman like her mother.","As time went by, the dynamic between the two of them changed.","Unexplainably, it started heading in the direction of an amusing antagonistic relationship.","In the public teaching building, the class bell rang.","Qi Shaobai balanced a book on his fingertip and leisurely climbed the stairs.","Suddenly, he saw Chi Xia hastily running up from below with her bag slung over her shoulder, panting for breath.","He couldn't help but make a sarcastic remark, \"You're late.\"","Chi Xia swiftly passed by him and gave him a fierce glare, saying, \"As if you weren't late.\"","Qi Shaobai couldn't hide his satisfaction, \"Our teacher doesn't take attendance.\"","Chi Xia: \"...\"","In the cafeteria, waiting in line for food.","\"Hey, directionally challenged—\"","Standing in separate lines, Qi Shaobai called out to Chi Xia.","\"—Has your class been notified about the specific holiday schedule for the National Day?\"","Without fully turning her head, Chi Xia had already identified the source of the voice from the lazy and insolent tone.","She turned her head and put on a fake smile, \"Yes, we've been informed. We're getting off this afternoon. Hurry back to your dorm and pack your luggage.\"","Qi Shaobai: \"...\"","Could she be any more obvious in her indifference?"]},{"number":222,"title":"Chapter 222: Qi Shaobai (4)","paragraphs":["Qi Shaobai had been busy with wedding matters recently. On top of that, he was having a good time dating a certain black dog after getting married, and was a bit slow to realize Sheng Mumu had changed.","It was one weekend when Qi Shaobai suddenly suggested reducing his pocket money over dinner that Sheng Mumu first caught a whiff of something strange.","No, something's not right!","What's up with this kid?","Whose family's good child would complain about too much pocket money?","Sheng Mumu: \"Young Qi, after receiving education from an institute of higher learning, your whole mindset has been sublimated, huh?\"","Qi Shaobai was rendered speechless, feeling ashamed. \"Uh... aren't you exaggerating a bit?\"","After all, he still couldn't completely support himself yet.","However, he already had a plan to write software programs while completing his studies, following in his dad's footsteps.","Even if it would be very difficult to earn a fortune like his dad's first bucket of gold, he should at least be able to cover his personal expenses.","He remembered what Sheng Mumu had told him before - \"If you make a promise, you have to keep it. If you can't do it or sense you won't be able to, you shouldn't have made the commitment in the first place.\"","You have to make plans when doing things and not make rash promises on the spur of the moment.","So a week ago, he had discussed ideas about starting a software business with a male classmate he was on good terms with.","They were both tech-heads who had tested into the software engineering department with high scores. They quickly reached an agreement to cooperate.","They could program and logicize, but were lacking when it came to socializing, communicating and organizing market demand.","It just so happened that when his good buddy Wei Zhaonan got wind of this, he thumped his chest and boasted shamelessly, \"I'm good at that! You guys just focus on the tech stuff and leave the social stuff to me, won't that work?\"","After thinking silently for a while, Qi Shaobai replied, \"Mm, cooperating with you, dad's assured.\"","Wei Zhaonan: \"...\"","And so, the fledgling entrepreneurial team took initial shape.","Qi Shaobai set a goal for himself to be self-sufficient in one year. Before that, he would only ask his family for basic living expenses.","Of course, this idea didn't just pop up all of a sudden.","One morning a week ago, the first class was an elective lecture that mixed students across departments.","As an elective with very few credits, teachers were relatively lax in their management.","After lazily eating breakfast, Qi Shaobai strolled in late to the classroom and sat in the last row, preparing to nap.","Just as he closed his eyes, the chatting from the girls in the front row floated to the back.","He inadvertently heard a few disjointed sentences.","-- \"Hey, did you hear? The beauty of our grade, Chi Xia, is working part-time at the cafe by the school gate. Her family situation isn't good?\" She doesn't look like it though.\"","-- \"No, no. I have a friend who's close with her dormmates. She sometimes goes over to hang out and got to know them quite well. Chi Xia not only comes from a well-off family, she's also especially good.\"","-- \"Oh? Then why...\"","-- \"I heard it's almost Mid-Autumn Festival. She wants to earn some money during her spare time to buy her parents gifts as a surprise.\"","-- \"Wow, she's so thoughtful!\"","Qi Shaobai, sprawled on the table trying to sleep, suddenly stiffened.","Lifting his head, his eyes took on a somewhat dazed and astonished look.","He didn't expect the outwardly cheerful and laughing beauty with no sense of direction would secretly work part-time jobs to surprise her parents.","Qi Shaobai found it hard not to see himself in her.","Not only did he not have the ability to earn money, his spending was very high.","He lowered his head, wanting to continue napping, but somehow couldn't fall asleep.","Of course Sheng Mumu didn't know all the complex reasons behind Qi Shaobai voluntarily suggesting to reduce his allowance.","She only fixed Qi Shaobai with a long, searching look.","Seeing the frankness and sincerity in his eyes with some kind of indescribable momentum, she no longer pursued asking for his reasons and consented to his decision.","\"Ok, approved.\"","\"Thanks...for bestowing favor.\"","If \"voluntarily reducing allowance\" could just be described as \"the child has grown up and has his own opinions,\" then another matter three months later completely led Sheng Mumu to think in a different direction.","At the time, Sheng Mumu and Qi Mo had returned from their honeymoon.","After playing abroad for many months, Sheng Mumu was desperate to indulge her love of the traditional Chinese joy of mahjong. She hurriedly called Su Tingran, Mrs. Sun and Mrs. Qian over to her house to play mahjong.","Several months prior, Zhang Housekeeper had opened up a comfortable area in the side parlor designated as a game room specifically for receiving madame's lady friends.","Sir would always \"just so happen\" to be very busy with work company matters whenever the lady's friends came over.","Zhang Housekeeper smiled silently.","With just a bit of thinking, anyone could guess sir definitely worried hosting a gathering with ladies would make the female guests ill at ease to chat freely in the presence of a man of the house.","Recently, sir had been utterly doting on madame, sometimes to the point that even an old hand like himself couldn't help feeling a bit uncomfortable witnessing their honeymoon phase.","It was an ordinary Thursday evening.","The four women chatted and played mahjong, having a wonderful time.","Just when Sheng Mumu was gleefully collecting money from a self-drawn hand of the Clear One Suit mahjong combination, noise came from the front door.","Following the sound, Qi Shaobai, who should have been at his university that day, appeared at the edge of her sight.","Sheng Mumu: \"???\"","Hearing the mahjong tiles colliding, Qi Shaobai also looked over at Sheng Mumu.","Qi Shaobai nodded deferentially at Su Tingran along with Mrs. Sun and Mrs. Qian to politely greet them, exchanging a few pleasantries before returning to his room. Not long after, he took a call and rushed out again, telling Sheng Mumu he had something to take care of outside.","Sheng Mumu was just about to call for him to be careful, but Qi Shaobai had already taken quick strides out the door, his figure out of sight.","The mahjong game ended.","Sheng Mumu did not return to her room, waiting instead in the living room.","She held her phone, wavering over and over on what to do.","On one hand, she felt Qi Shaobai was already 18 and an adult.","If she called to grill him about where he had gone and what he was up to in the middle of the night, wouldn't that seem like she wasn't giving him personal space?","On the other hand, she also felt given how unusual Qi Shaobai was acting today, not asking would feel amiss.","Just as she opened her contacts with her finger hovering over the name \"Kiddo\", the door opened.","Qi Shaobai was back.","Sheng Mumu felt relieved.","But before she could even feel at ease for a few seconds, upon seeing Qi Shaobai had several scrapes on his face that weren't there when he left the house, she immediately became apprehensive again.","She raised her voice, \"How did you get hurt? Did you get into a fight?\"","Qi Shaobai turned his head away, zipping up his hoodie, wanting to cover himself.","\"No fighting. I accidentally fell.\"","\"Come off it. Tell me the truth. Your dad isn't home right now. Old rule, I'll keep your secret.\"","\"I'm not lying, I really only took a spill.\"","Sheng Mumu couldn't quite believe it and inspected Qi Shaobai's face over and over to confirm his injuries were only superficial scrapes without any marks of an altercation before finally being able to relax.","Being so harried made Sheng Mumu forget to ask why Qi Shaobai had suddenly returned home on a Thursday.","It was only half an hour later, as she was helping Qi Shaobai dab iodine on his wounds, she reflected on how he had kept his left hand in his pocket the whole time.","The more she thought about it, the more peculiar she found it.","Something's very suspect!","She hurried downstairs in slippers, knocking on Qi Shaobai's room door.","After a while, the door opened.","Qi Shaobai stood inside, oddly decked out in long sleeves and pants loungewear, out of character. At this sight, Sheng Mumu had \"nice try, do I look that stupid\" practically written on her face.","It needed to be known that even with the heavy snow last year in Shen City, the brat wandered around the villa in t-shirts, not afraid of the cold.","Sheng Mumu quirked her brow, not wasting a beat in pulling him over by his left hand and yanking his sleeve up.","Caught by surprise, Qi Shaobai gaped, flustered.","When Sheng Mumu saw Qi Shaobai's left wrist, she blanked. \"......\"","The air was frozen, both parties at a loss for words.","Qi Shaobai didn't know how to explain.","As for Sheng Mumu, she was completely dumbfounded.","After a long while, she slowly lifted her head, expression extremely complicated: \"????\"","It was as if saying: What nonsense is this? Is this what you were trying to hide?","Qi Shaobai awkwardly averted his gaze, the corners of his mouth faintly curving upwards imperceptibly.","Whether it was chagrin at getting his secret exposed or more like... bashfulness?","As it turned out, what he had kept tucked in his pocket not wanting her to spot, was a very conspicuous orange fawn pattern bandage wrapped around his left wrist.","Sheng Mumu didn't pry further but she was very clear in her heart.","Even if the King of Hell came, there was no way this cartoon bandage suited Qi Shaobai's outward image and temperament.","The fact that Qi Shaobai allowed something that clashed with his looks to be pasted on him and even deliberately tried to hide it, could only mean one thing.","The person who put it on him was very special.","Time jump to a few hours later—","Middle of the night.","Sheng Mumu suddenly opened her eyes, extremely alert.","Her hands carefully stretched out from above the quilt, clapping silently in the air.","Ah ah ah, so excited that I can't sleep. I accidentally caught a glimpse of the budding of young love ah ah ah.","I kinda want to eat candy, is this normal?","Perhaps sensing that the woman in his arms was restless in her sleep, the man circling her waist with his arm tightened his grip.","Without opening his eyes, Qi Mo moved closer, his voice low and hoarse as he familiarly called out to her.","\"Wife...can't sleep?\"","As if talking in his dreams.","But Sheng Mumu knew clearly that this was not just dream talk, because the big hand around her waist had already started roaming restlessly.","She pressed a palm against the man's forehead and gave him a push.","\"Sleeping, don't bother me.\"","No one could disturb her sugar high."]},{"number":223,"title":"Chapter 223: Qi Shaobai (5)","paragraphs":["That night.","Sheng Mumu was not the only one who slept poorly.","In the room downstairs, Qi Shaobai also sat up irritably in the middle of the night.","He raised his hand and messed up his hair randomly.","The more he thought about it, the more confused he was.","What the hell was I panicking about just now?","It was just a minor injury. A clueless girl insisted on putting on a bandaid. I couldn't convince her not to, so I let her put it on. That's it.","It was a very normal thing. Why did I feel guilty?","This is too strange.","Noticing something was wrong with himself, Qi Shaobai started propping his chin and pretended to be lost in thought.","With a serious expression, he analyzed his inner world.","About ten minutes passed.","His deeply furrowed brows finally relaxed slightly.","He came to a conclusion.","The crux of everything was that the bandaid was too ugly.","Since he was little, ever since he could remember, there had never been anything with cute cartoon patterns on his body.","Not even a tiny piece.","It would make him feel uncomfortable, very reasonable.","\"Oh, so that's why.\"","Having found the answer, Qi Shaobai finally went to bed with relief.","*","There were no classes that afternoon. Qi Shaobai went with his roommates to play basketball at a newly opened indoor basketball court off campus.","After working up a big sweat, they walked back to school while chatting.","As winter came, the temperature in Beijing plummeted suddenly.","Qi Shaobai and his friends had just sweated. Wearing only thin sportswear, they drew some sideways glances as they walked down the street.","Christmas was coming soon. Many small shops along the streets off campus had already started decorating early.","An employee was attaching snowflake and reindeer sticker patterns to the glass exterior wall.","The door was open, and the Christmas songs playing inside floated outside.","As Qi Shaobai walked by and heard it, he glanced sideways at the small shop, his eyes lingering for a few seconds.","The holidays are coming again, time flies so fast.","In fact, Qi Shaobai never used to be so sensitive about holidays.","Having grown up with Grandma Qi, the older generation didn't celebrate Western festivals.","Later, when he lived with his dad, the two men even less cared about such niceties.","But ever since Sheng Mumu joined the family, things started to change.","On all the major traditional Chinese festivals like Mid-Autumn Festival, Lantern Festival and Dragon Boat Festival, they would make plans to celebrate together in advance.","In addition, there were also many holidays he had never even heard of before.","All kinds of obscure holidays, he even often suspected she was making things up.","The time Qi Shaobai felt was the most ridiculous was a Sunday not long ago.","Sheng Mumu gave the two Qi's short notice at noon, asking them to go out for a buffet dinner together that night.","When they got to the restaurant, Sheng Mumu raised her glass and said, \"Cheers, happy holiday!\"","Qi Shaobai racked his brains but couldn't think of what holiday it was.","Only after asking did he find out it was Thailand's \"Monkey Buffet Festival\" that day.","Even Qi Mo, who was usually quite able to go along with her ideas, was at a loss for words this time.","Not to mention Qi Shaobai, whose surprise was written all over his face as he asked directly:","\"Monkey Buffet Festival? Is it appropriate for us to cheers to that?\"","\"We're all primates. Why not take advantage of an excuse to celebrate a holiday? The monkeys won't mind.\" Sheng Mumu nonchalantly replied with a smile, clinking glasses.","Qi Shaobai: \"......\" Is it possible, it's not whether the monkeys mind, but that I mind......","Recalling this scene, Qi Shaobai felt amused.","\"What's wrong with you, did you eat the wrong medicine or something? You just started laughing out of nowhere while walking?\"","Roommate A was the closest with Qi Shaobai. Usually he loved to mock and banter. Seeing the usually sour-faced Qi Shaobai suddenly laugh like a psycho, he naturally didn't miss the chance to ridicule him.","As expected, Qi Shaobai didn't disappoint, fighting back with his sharp tongue as usual.","\"Yeah, I was planning to take some vitamins before going out, but I didn't pay attention and accidentally took your idiot pills instead.\"","\"If I bring you food again, I'm a dog.\"","\"Oh no, big bro, next time I'll pay attention when I eat them.\"","\"Get lost.\"","\"Didn't you say you wanted me to join you in the qualifying match tonight?\"","\"I misspoke. Please forgive me for offending you, big bro.\" The two continued walking, talking to each other formally as brothers.","As they passed the girls' dorm building, they spotted a crowd gathered up ahead.","Qi Shaobai had no interest in rubbernecking, and walked by with droopy eyes.","But his roommate had a personality that loved spectacles. Before even getting close, he was already craning his neck to watch the excitement.","As he watched the commotion, he chattered incessantly:","\"Yo, someone's setting up candles to confess over there again.\"","\"Damn, that's the third time I've seen it happen in a month.\"","\"666, they've pulled out all the stops this time. Not only candles but flowers too.\"","It wasn't uncommon to see guys setting up candles and flowers to confess under the girls' dorms on university campuses.","Especially in places like Beijing University of Science and Technology with a male to female ratio of 6:1. It was nothing out of the ordinary.","Qi Shaobai couldn't be bothered to even glance at it. He sauntered lazily along.","Behind him, the confessing boy's sonorous voice carried over the crowd, coming through clearly.","\"Chi——Xia——I love you! Will——you——be——my——girlfriend?\"","Qi Shaobai stopped abruptly in his tracks.","???","Chi Xia?","\"Chi Xia?\" His roommate looked at Qi Shaobai in surprise and said, \"Damn, this guy's digging your corner. He's got some balls.\"","Qi Shaobai gave his roommate a sharp glare.","\"Don't talk nonsense.\"","He had explained to his dorm mates many times that he and Chi Xia were just friends. But they didn't believe him, adamantly insisting that there was something going on between them. They even claimed that \"those involved are blind while bystanders see clearly.\"","As luck would have it, Chi Xia had also mentioned that she faced similar annoyances.","Apparently her dorm mates also suspected that there was more than friendship between them.","But that was not the case. They had always just been friends, interacting openly and candidly.","These rumors didn't significantly impact their relationship. They both had personalities that didn't care much what others thought of them. On the contrary, because others misunderstood that they were about to start dating, some admirers who originally wanted to pursue them got cold feet, feeling inferior and not daring to confess their feelings.","As a result, they were conveniently left in peace.","Clearly, the boy making a big fuss under the girls' dorm building today didn't fall into the group of timid admirers.","Qi Shaobai's brows twitched slightly. Though he had just uttered words indicating he was unrelated to this matter, his feet couldn't help but shift toward the crowd.","With his chin slightly raised, taking advantage of his height, he quickly peered over the people blocking his view to see the boy surrounded in the middle.","Without realizing it himself, as he looked at that boy, his gaze grew gradually darker, and he secretly clenched his fist.","With knitted brows, his already grumpy face appeared even colder and gloomier.","The boy held pink roses, looking up at the building while shouting a few more times.","Still no response.","The onlookers seemed to guess that the girl being confessed to was directly ignoring him.","Just as the onlookers were losing patience, Chi Xia appeared at the dorm entrance.","There was an uproar among the crowd.","The boy holding the flowers was invigorated, egged on by the voices of the onlookers. He quickly walked up a few steps.","No one noticed that one person in the crowd slowly darkened his gaze, quietly balling his fist.","The people around them were still clamoring.","Chi Xia was expressionless. When the boy got close, she shook her head coldly and seemed to say something with pursed lips.","They were too far away for others to hear clearly.","But judging by the boy's dejected turn and the hands holding the flowers suddenly dropping, the outcome was already clear.","The onlookers seemed to feel it was awkward to watch someone's confession get rejected, and the crowd dispersed shortly after.","Chi Xia stood at the top of the stairs in front of her dorm building wearing a Pink Bear sleep set.","She had been showering in her dorm when her roommate informed her of the situation downstairs.","Having no choice, she gave up the golden sheet mask time after showering and came downstairs to resolve the issue, worried that the noise might affect other dorm residents.","Annoying.","Truly annoying.","That precious post-mask time! So hard to come by!","She looked up with her head tilted back, hands in the pajama pockets, and let out a soft sigh.","She didn't initially react that she was wearing pajamas. Her hands automatically reached to the pockets in her pants before realizing mid-air that the Pink Bear outfit had a pocket on the belly.","Qi Shaobai caught this silly yet adorable scene with amusement dancing in the corners of his mouth.","It was then that Chi Xia noticed Qi Shaobai.","She looked astonished, craning her neck further.","Her expression seemed to say: What are you doing here?","After exchanging a few words with his roommate, Qi Shaobai's roommate left first while Qi Shaobai walked over to Chi Xia.","He opened with sarcasm:","\"Not bad, pretty cool. Rejecting someone in just a few sentences, you seem quite experienced with the process.\"","Chi Xia glared at him, too lazy to respond.","\"I didn't realize you enjoy rubbernecking so much. A loyal fan of gossip platform 1818?\"","Qi Shaobai touched the back of his neck, \"I just got here, happened to be passing by.\"","\"Oh, I see.\"","Chi Xia did not doubt the truthfulness of his words, after all the two really did often run into each other on the road.","It was as if they were tied together by an invisible thread, supernatural even.","The two chatted for a few more sentences about other things, and Qi Shaobai noticed Chi Xia make a movement to shrink her neck. Glancing down, he saw that her hands were still stuffed in her pockets the whole time.","\"Alright, it's getting late. I still have to go back to the dormitory to lead my team in the promotion matches. Let's chat another day.\"","Having said that, Qi Shaobai lazily waved his hand to say goodbye.","\"Wait.\"","Chi Xia suddenly called out to stop him.","Qi Shaobai: \"Hmm?\"","Chi Xia: \"Wait for me for a minute, I'll be right down.\"","After she spoke, she turned and ran towards the dorm building without looking back. She solemnly added:","\"Wait for me! Don't leave first!\"","\"???\" Qi Shaobai was puzzled as he stood frozen in place, completely confused.","In less than a minute, Chi Xia appeared in front of Qi Shaobai, gasping for breath.","Before he could react, Chi Xia had already stuffed a thick coat into his arms.","\"Put on some clothes, so other out-of-town students won't think we Beijingers have weird body constitutions, wandering around in single layers when it's the dead of winter.\"","\"Here, this is the biggest coat I could find. You should be able to wear it.\"","Qi Shaobai was stunned.","He really did not expect that Chi Xia had rushed upstairs because she saw he was wearing too little.","He hesitated for a moment, \"I just finished playing basketball, I'm drenched in sweat.\"","Implying that, aren't you afraid of my sweat being dirty?","Chi Xia smiled gently, \"So remember to dry clean it and return it to me later, don't think about dumping it on me to wash.\"","After a few seconds, Qi Shaobai said \"Okay.\"","\"Go back to your dorm quickly, I'm in no rush to wear this coat back, just return it to me whenever we bump into each other next time.\" Chi Xia shrunk her neck and turned her head breezily, \"I'm going, bye!\"","\"Bye.\"","On the way back to the dormitory, Qi Shaobai still did not put on the coat Chi Xia gave him.","Lightly carrying it in his hand, he could feel the soft touch of the fabric against his palm.","In a certain part of his heart, it seemed to have also turned soft.","Small Theater:","Night time.","The boys' dormitory.","Roommates frantically complain:","\"Ahhh, Qi Shaobai, what's up with you today? Usually you'd chase five people by yourself and kill them all, how did you become like a noob today with the wrong equipment and all that?\"","\"......\"","\"If you ask me to carry you again I'm a dog.\"","\"......\""]},{"number":224,"title":"Chapter 224: Qi Shaobai (6)","paragraphs":["Ever since Sheng Mumu learned that Qi Shaobai might have developed feelings for her, she couldn't help but be curious and inquire about the details in the past few months.","She didn't know who the girl was that had put a giraffe band-aid on Qi Shaobai.","She only remembered that the name of the female lead in the original book was Chixia, a very good girl.","She couldn't be sure if Qi Shaobai's romantic storyline had continued to develop the same way after she crossed over to this world.","It was impossible to investigate a girl named \"Chixia\" solely based on a name.","Helpless, she could only try to indirectly probe for information.","What was infuriating was that this Qi Shaobai had become quite crafty recently.","No matter how she tried to ask in different ways, she couldn't get him to spill the beans. And he always had things to do on weekends, so she didn't even get the chance to ask further.","On this day, just as Sheng Mumu was feeling frustrated about not being able to eat fresh melon, the phone rang.","She answered the call, and Qin Jiamu's voice sounded extremely anxious.","\"Mumu, what should I do...\"","\"What's wrong?\" Sheng Mumu's heart tightened.","\"Just now, a neighbor called me and said they saw my daughter and a boy who seemed a bit shady laughing and talking while waiting in line at the restaurant entrance...\"","Sheng Mumu could hear the urgency in Qin Jiamu's voice and said, \"Don't worry, take your time and tell me...\"","\"Well... under normal circumstances, it wouldn't be a big deal. It's normal for her to have friends of the opposite sex or classmates. But recently, I've noticed that my daughter has been different. She's always on her phone messaging, and when I ask her who she's talking to, she only says it's a college classmate.\"","Qin Jiamu's voice softened a bit as she continued, \"I believe she wouldn't do anything inappropriate, and if she's really in a relationship, she would definitely tell me. But with her recent unusual behavior, I can't help but worry and speculate.\"","Sheng Mumu understood Qin Jiamu's concerns.","Raising a daughter was different from raising a son, and it always required more attention.","Qin Jiamu said, \"Calling and asking directly would seem too deliberate. I want to quietly go there and take a quick look, just a glimpse, to confirm if that boy matches the description the neighbor gave. Mumu, can you accompany me?\"","Qin Jiamu planned to take a distant look to ease her current worries.","Later in the evening, when her daughter returned home, she would have a private conversation with her.","\"Sure!\" Sheng Mumu agreed.","Qin Jiamu mentioned the name of a restaurant.","Sheng Mumu knew that restaurant. She had been there with Qimo before, and it had been very popular recently.","If they didn't make a reservation a few days in advance, they would have to wait for at least an hour on the spot.","By the time they arrived, her daughter should still be there.","While comforting Qin Jiamu on the phone, Sheng Mumu quickly changed her clothes and left the house.","Ten minutes later, the two of them met in the dining area on the second floor of a shopping district.","When they arrived at the opposite side of the target restaurant, they stood about a dozen meters apart and looked inside through the large glass walls.","Suddenly, Qin Jiamu nudged Sheng Mumu's arm.","\"I see her, I see Xiaxia.\"","It was the first time Sheng Mumu heard her daughter's name from Qin Jiamu's mouth.","Previously, when she mentioned her daughter, she would call her \"Little Ancestor.\"","It's quite a coincidence that Sheng Mumu and Qin Jiamu have known each other for a long time and started a business together. They have a close relationship, but they rarely talk about their families.","On one hand, there are too many interesting things and numerous topics to discuss, so they don't specifically talk about their children.","On the other hand, now that their children are grown up, they value their reputation and probably don't want to become idle topics of conversation among parents.","Furthermore, Su Tingran doesn't have children, so when the three of them go out together for beauty treatments and shopping, they deliberately avoid topics that only two people can participate in.","As a result, apart from knowing that they both have children of the same age, Sheng Mumu and Qin Jiamu don't have a deeper understanding of each other's families.","\"Jiamu, which one is Xiaxia?\" Sheng Mumu searched with her eyes, asking for directions.","\"The seat by the window, second table from the right, facing us,\" Qin Jiamu replied, her gaze fixed on the back of the boy sitting across from their daughter.","She wished she could discern the boy's personality and appearance from the back of his head.","Seeing her like this, Sheng Mumu also became serious, furrowing her brows as she looked over.","Her gaze was intense.","She vowed to scrutinize Jiamu's daughter's potential partner strictly.","She muttered to herself inwardly.","By the window... second table from the right...","Hmm, found it.","The girl is very beautiful, certainly Jiamu's daughter, with some resemblance in her features.","Soon, her gaze shifted sideways, directed at the back of the boy sitting across from Jiamu's daughter.","Suddenly, her eyes narrowed.","\"Hiss—\"","He looks so familiar.","Have I seen him somewhere before???","Not sure, let's take another look!","That fluffy back of his head moved.","The boy's hand relaxed and rested on the back of the chair. He shifted to a more comfortable sitting position, his face slightly turned toward their direction, engaged in a light conversation with the person across from him.","A buzzing sound.","Sheng Mumu's head was buzzing.","She suddenly grabbed Qin Jiamu's wrist.","\"This is my son! Qi Shaobai!\" she exclaimed.","\"What???!\" Qin Jiamu was stunned by this statement, unable to believe it. She pointed with her finger, \"You mean that boy over there is your son?\"","Sheng Mumu took a while to recover from her shock.","\"Yes, I'm very sure, it must be him.\"","How could she not recognize Qi Shaobai?","In an instant, countless images flashed through her mind.","Oh my goodness.","She racked her brains to gossip about Qi Shaobai's potential love interest, and it turned out that it was right here, right in front of them!","It was Jiamu's daughter!","Xiaxia...","Jiamu just mentioned Xiaxia.","Chi Xia, Xiaxia.","It must be her, no doubt about it!","Sheng Mumu felt incredibly foolish, clapping her hands and sighing.","But she didn't forget to reassure Qin Jiamu.","\"Jiamu, rest assured, this kid Qi Shaobai might have a sour face, looking impatient, but he's actually very kind and innocent, without a trace of ill-intent.\"","\"I trust you, I trust your son,\" Qin Jiamu said, looking at Qi Shaobai's profile attentively, gradually recalling.","\"Oh, yes, it's him. I met him before, on the day I met you, at Yizhong. Your son helped my daughter find her way.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"???\"","Well, well, there's that too?","Qin Jiamu: \"What a scare, fortunately, it was just a misunderstanding.\"","Sheng Mumu also placed her hand on her chest, trying to ease the immense impact, and let out a sigh of relief, \"Phew.\"","Wait a moment.","Her body stiffened, as if she suddenly remembered something important, lost in thought.","Jiamu, Qin Jiamu!","Qin Jiamu! My future mother-in-law!!!","She realized belatedly, a sudden realization dawning upon her.","Her pupils trembled repeatedly, as if in shock. (trembling pupils.jpg)","Suddenly, they switched to a gentle motherly smile. (loving mother.jpg)","The answer had been written in the title all along.","She and Qin Jiamu were destined to become relatives.","Sheng Mumu's occasional daze and motherly smile left Qin Jiamu dumbfounded, who waved her hand in front of her eyes.","\"Mumu—hey, Mumu—what are you doing?\"","Sheng Mumu was daydreaming about the scene when Qishaobai formally introduced Xiaxia to her and Qishaobai, and was suddenly brought back to reality by Qin Jiamu's voice.","She smirked.","\"Future mother-in-law~ Are you hungry or not? Let's go to the restaurant floor and have something to eat, shall we?\"","Qin Jiamu was puzzled, \"?\"","Why did Mumu suddenly call her by her full name in such a strange manner?","Sheng Mumu linked her arm with Qin Jiamu's and enthusiastically pulled her towards a hot pot restaurant.","\"While I slowly introduce you to Qishaobai, you can also chat with me about Xiaxia.\"","Qin Jiamu: \"???\"","During the hot pot meal, Sheng Mumu and Qin Jiamu reached a preliminary consensus.","Since they were already well-acquainted with each other's families, there was no need to inquire further with the children.","Let them develop freely.","How far they go will depend on themselves. (referencing a book)","They're in college now, the age when they can fall in love. They won't interfere too much.","Sheng Mumu secretly delighted.","Unable to contain her laughter while Qin Jiamu went to the restroom, she chuckled inwardly.","Inner thoughts: I understand this child, Xiaxia, even though it's my first time meeting her, but I understand her well.","In summary, she's a good girl.","An exceptionally, exceptionally, exceptionally good girl.","With me, Sheng Mumu, by their side, I will definitely help little Qishaobai succeed in pursuing his wife!","That's fantastic~ I'm so happy~"]},{"number":225,"title":"Chapter 225: The Wedding","paragraphs":["According to Sheng Mumu's idea, there would be very few guests at the wedding.","The wedding venue was set outdoors, on a private plot of land owned by the Qi Group.","It was a sunny autumn day.","The grass stretched as far as the eye could see.","Orange fire spirit rose flowers dotted the large venue.","Sheng Mumu had specifically checked - her lucky color this month was orange.","The meaning behind the fire spirit rose happened to match the love she envisioned.","She decided in a split second - the wedding flowers must be it.","The passionate color of the fresh flowers and the slightly bleak hue of the autumn grass created a unique warm atmosphere.","Casual yet refined.","Gentle yet steady.","Like her, and like him.","Flowers filled the banquet, and a light breeze brought waves of floral fragrance.","Qi Mo, dressed in a dark suit, stood tall and straight at one end of the aisle.","To others, he still had that calm and unruffled aura about him that they were familiar with.","Only Qi Mo himself knew that his palms had been sweating the whole time.","His heart was pounding against his chest, as if it would jump out any second.","The final note of the soothing piano version of Pachelbel's Canon faded away.","Sheng Mumu, dressed in pure white bridal gown, appeared at the other end of the aisle.","At that very moment, as if on cue, the song switched to the next one.","It was a Cantonese song called \"I Got Married\", with the sweet, joyful voice of the singer floating in the air.","This was a song Sheng Mumu really liked. Whenever she heard it, her eyes would redden and her nose would turn sour. She didn't dare listen too much.","Just imagining it made her feel moved.","And now, being in it herself, her heartstrings were even more stirred.","Sheng Mumu forced herself to hold it in and keep her emotions under control.","At this moment, everyone's gaze was focused on her.","Sheng Mumu looked especially breathtaking today. With no blush on, a faint pink flush of shyness had already appeared on her cheeks.","Qiao Li was the bridesmaid. She had just been with Sheng Mumu in the dressing room to help her change and do her hair and makeup earlier. Sheng Mumu was still chatting away without any nervousness then. But in just a short while, she was like a different person.","Standing at the side, Qiao Li could see Sheng Mumu's other hand behind her back being pinched red by her fingertips, slightly shaking, as if trying hard to restrain her emotions.","The song happened to play this line—","\"My good friend don't be scared","This day will surprise you too","Who would expect love to come so magically","That I can meet him\"","Sheng Mumu turned to glance at Qiao Li, lips pursed slightly.","As if conversing with her, telling her not to worry.","Qiao Li's eyes instantly reddened and she looked away.","Afraid that being too emotional herself would make Sheng Mumu tear up too.","From the moment Sheng Mumu appeared, Qi Mo's gaze had not left her.","They had not seen each other for the past three days since three days ago.","To maintain the sense of mystery and anticipation before the wedding, Sheng Mumu had deliberately stayed with Ting Ran and Qiao Li for the past three days.","Although reluctant, Qi Mo was willing to go along as long as she was happy.","Ever since they got together, whenever he went on a business trip, he would hurry to finish work and return home as soon as possible, keeping in contact through calls and video chats every night.","Not allowing him to even make a video call like this for three days straight was the first time ever.","This was the first time he realized how unbearable it was to miss someone.","Sheng Mumu was not much better off herself.","Despite her past claims that \"not being in love means you won't die, being alone and happy is great too\", she now had to admit that when you meet the right person, your heart would uncontrollably worry for the other person.","The melodious singing continued—","\"I got married","Red fresh flowers","Long wedding dress","Walking down the aisle slowly\"","The bride and groom standing at both ends of the aisle locked eyes.","Qi Mo raised his brows at Sheng Mumu, as if asking.","Sheng Mumu nodded slightly, shifting her hand to the hem of her skirt, lifting it up.","This was the secret signal they had agreed on beforehand.","The next second.","They both strode towards each other at the same time.","Guests on both sides looked over with blessings in their smiles.","Sheng Mumu had rejected Cheng Xin's idea of walking her down the aisle.","She felt that weddings were a decision made by the two people.","It was not a ceremony of handing a daughter from one family to another.","But a firm choice of two people running towards what their hearts desired.","The song was still playing—","\"The bride's makeup can fade slowly too","Let me take another look at my parents","As they cover my head with the veil, lightly straightening my skirt\"","Dressed in a bridal gown, Sheng Mumu was already unable to walk very fast to begin with.","This lyric tripped her heart, making her steps even slower.","She raised her head to look at the sky, thinking of her parents.","Dad, Mum, I miss you so much.","Your daughter is getting married today. Can you feel it from the other world?","Every step of my growth, every look, every expression, even my living habits, catchphrases, and taste preferences, are imprinted with your shadows.","Missing cannot be turned into something tangible to traverse time and space, but it always melts into the genes and blood.","Every minute, every second, I'm still loving you.","When it came to parents and loved ones, it touched her soft spot.","Not daring to think too much, afraid she would lose control of her emotions, she looked away.","The moment she lowered her eyes, she caught a glimpse of Cheng Xin and Cheng Zhuo at the periphery of her vision.","She saw Cheng Xin secretly pressing at the corner of his eyes.","Cheng Zhuo's lips were pursed in a straight line, hands on his knees, wrinkling his trousers, even more nervous and agitated than her.","Sheng Mumu's heart quivered.","It was as if a stream of warmth flowed into her heart.","She was so grateful to them.","For giving her another family in this world.","At both ends of the long aisle.","The old lady smiled, eyes crinkling.","Mother-in-law Feng Yaoqin supported the old lady, also beaming with joy.","Ting Ran and Jia Mu clasped their hands eagerly.","Zhang Housekeeper no longer hid his fatherly smile, the corners of his lips nearly reaching his ears.","Even Assistant Dong and Xiao Wang came, watching Qi Mo as if their idol, faces flushed with excitement.","There was also Jiang Doctor and her mentor.","As well as Mahjong Aunt Sun, Mrs. Qian...","No matter how long the aisle was, she would eventually walk it.","There wasn't enough time for Sheng Mumu to respond to every congratulatory look.","But she would remember how they looked today.","The two were originally supposed to meet in the middle of the aisle.","But Qi Mo was too impatient, failing to grasp the right pace and also overlooking the small marker lines on the carpet. He reached Sheng Mumu first.","He lowered his head to look at her, the gleam in his dark pupils like splintering ink, still as handsome as when they first met.","Seeing the tear tracks at the corners of her eyes, he raised his hand to gently brush them away for her.","Thump Thump —","Their hearts beating loudly could be heard clearly by them both.","No matter how long they had been together.","Each time they drew close, the heart-skipping sensation was unstoppable.","The noisy chatter around them increased sharply.","Amidst the laughter, Qi Shaobai, dressed in a full suit, appeared holding a flower basket.","Seeing him in formalwear was a rare sight, instantly astonishing everyone.","Assistant Dong secretly said to Xiao Wang: \"His aura is exactly the same as Boss Qi, totally alike, what a similar imposing manner.\"","\"You're so right. I almost blurted out Boss Qi just now.\"","\"Haha, maybe we'll really have to call him that in the future. Let's get used to it in advance.\"","\"Mm, you're right.\"","Qi Shaobai's role today was the flower boy.","As a flower boy, he was admittedly slightly overaged.","But who could say he wasn't the most suitable flower boy candidate?","This was something he had actively fought for after all.","Qi Shaobai strode to the middle of the aisle, standing at the side of the two, professionally holding up the flower basket.","Inside the flower basket was the ring box.","Apart from that, there was also a deep red jewelry box that Sheng Mumu had not seen before.","Just as she was feeling puzzled, Qi Mo had already taken out the ring and carefully put it on her ring finger.","Right after, he opened that unfamiliar deep red jewelry box.","Click—","The exquisite clasp on the jewelry box was unlatched.","Her gaze was arrested in an instant.","Before her eyes was a string of white jade beads.","Sunrays shining on it resulted in a translucent luminous halo, extremely pleasing to the eye.","What surprised her most was that faint red could be glimpsed inside the largest white jade bead in the center.","The pairing of crimson and smooth white was elegant and delicate.","Knowing she must be confused now, Qi Mo gazed at her and slowly opened his lips:","\"Carved dice with red beans ensconced, this bone-deep longing, do you know?\"","Sheng Mumu's heart tightened abruptly.","The white jade actually contained red beans inside!","The ancient verse expressing utmost longing had been turned into reality by him.","Qi Mo wanted to tell her that his feelings for her had reached deep into his bones — did she know?","Qi Mo stared unwaveringly at Sheng Mumu's crystal clear, tear-brimmed eyes.","His voice slightly trembling, low and ardent.","\"I had thought about really taking out a piece of bone, consulted professionals about it. They told me it wouldn't look good, and would easily change color over time. Later I contacted a chemical research institute...\"","Sheng Mumu didn't hear the last part of what he said clearly.","She was amused by Qi Mo's serious and earnest explanation of his actions, letting out a muffled chuckle.","Tears had just welled up, yet now she was laughing. Without needing to think, she knew her current expression must be a mess.","How annoying! She had maintained her emotions for so long, perfectly presenting an idol-level facial expression management. Yet it was shattered with just one sentence from this man.","Yet she could not bring herself to blame him.","Alright, she was in the wrong.","She had previously criticized him for lacking romance, for being too rigid.","But that wasn't the case at all.","His solemn yet profound affection always managed to strike her heart when she least expected it.","It was like that in the past.","And it would continue to be so in the future.","(The End)"]}]);
